ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_FeatTable.uexp,,5B0EDF6942130768E79F8D9C943C57F1,"It's pretty usefull to be able to craft your own Codex Piscium, especially if you lost yours... be more carefull with your stuff please..."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,A4E4774E4BB69722C51BDE9E93CA6303,Minnow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,21E0345944ECFABF7791BFB3B9C8AF41,"A tiny, darting fish. Common but useful as bait."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,12BDF89F4B8E0D1C4622E6A4AC5006FD,"A field journal where every catch leaves its mark: a hasty sketch, a measurement in cm, the biome and the period of the encounter. Far to the east, in the islands of Yamatai, scholars call such a tome a 'Piscidex'. The name has yet to take root among the exiles, but the practice is the same. Inscribed on the first page in faded ink: ""Catch them all."""
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,4CE3A0904ACB3825E7D1D897C393F837,Ratchet Crank
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,EC660E01482B37B3E113C0A5F31FFB97,Unlocks fish fatigue while reeling
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,BF69B06143B689DBF7909DB19BF861FF,"A geared bronze crank whose ratchet bites down on every turn, holding each hard-won length of line so none slips back. Fitted to your reel and kept in your pack, it lets you wear a thrashing fish to exhaustion the great and legendary catches that once snapped taut lines and vanished can at last be brought to shore."
