ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourney.uexp,,3693ECAC40218890478CF7A3721E2BFD,"The rivers and lakes of the Exiled Lands offer sustenance to those willing to wait. A rod, some bait, and the right spot are all an exile needs."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,F416109442CD8E11C356C39E574C6A98,Craft a Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,D6E3E0BC4C0F1E39DBCD0B86AC9875F6,Open your inventory and craft a Fishing Rod from the crafting menu. <br><br>It requires only basic materials and no crafting station.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,4248F4D24D734417CD5571AEB3A4C1DE,Craft an Insect Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,A847B2674FF7ED2303D708A6827928ED,"Bait is required to fish. Open your inventory and craft some bait from the handcrafting menu. <br><br>Once crafted, equip your fishing rod and load the bait onto it the same way you would load arrows onto a bow."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,FDBD97FB4524B1F7F8BCAD8532016503,Catch a Fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,997CFE404B9D829C722D9A943BC07BA9,"Equip your fishing rod and approach any body of water. Use Start Fishing in your emotes radial menu (default: R) to cast your line, then wait for a fish to bite. <br><br>When the mini-game starts, keep the fish inside the capture zone until the progress bar fills to reel it in. (Press LMB to go up, release to go down)"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,4F7F5C194C312FD6743BE8856B80DCC3,Cook a Fish Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,8AA7374741352F1531ED188CE4308C06,Caught fish can be processed into fillets at the Stove. Fillets are used as ingredients to craft higher-tier fishing equipment and bait. <br><br>Different fish yield different fillets depending on their biome and tier.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,DB2BFF7C4DDA3FC4B8484081F2A06788,Craft a piece of Fisher's Equipment
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,A4EF09894E204FB8C899DA8B33B8766B,"Fisher's equipment is crafted at the Armorer's Bench. Each piece increases your Fishing Power, which improves your odds of catching rarer fish and reduces the time between bites. <br><br>Fisher's equipment occupies your armor slots."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,DA85258B4D1888A53A4213AEC6BD7A73,Craft a Fishing Accessory
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/Journey/DT_Fishing_NewJourneyStep.uexp,,9A90523648F8DCE7BA9688BA66F9DFED,"Fishing accessories are crafted at the Tinker's Bench. They provide passive bonuses while fishing and do not need to be equipped, simply keep them in your inventory. <br><br>Only one of each accessory is counted. Carrying duplicates provides no additional benefit."
ConanSandbox/Content/ModsShared/JaarFishing/DT_ExilesFishing_Texts.uexp,,DA90DFA84F936A136857DD95B17C95E1,You don't have bait.
