ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389211_LongDesc,A masterwork hat lined with thin steel plates and decorated with fish-bone charms. It marks the wearer as a true master of the art.
