ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389212_Name,Master Angler's Vest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389212_ShortDesc,A steel-plated fishing vest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389212_LongDesc,"A masterfully crafted vest reinforced with steel plates, yet flexible enough for casting. The mark of a seasoned angler."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389212_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389213_Name,Master Angler's Gloves
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389213_ShortDesc,Steel-tipped precision gloves
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389213_LongDesc,Expertly crafted gloves with articulated steel fingertips. They grant unparalleled control over line and hook.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389213_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389214_Name,Master Angler's Pants
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389214_ShortDesc,Steel-reinforced waders
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389214_LongDesc,Heavy wading trousers reinforced with steel rivets and oiled leather. They keep you bone-dry even in chest-deep water.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389214_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389215_Name,Master Angler's Boots
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389215_ShortDesc,Steel-soled deep-water boots
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389215_LongDesc,"Masterwork boots built for standing in torrential rapids. The steel soles grip any surface, and the sealed seams keep water out completely."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389215_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389216_Name,Legendary Angler's Cap
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389216_ShortDesc,A star metal fishing crown
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389216_LongDesc,"A magnificent headpiece woven with star metal threads. The ancient metal hums near water, attuning its wearer to the movements of fish below."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389216_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389217_Name,Legendary Angler's Vest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389217_ShortDesc,A star metal fishing coat
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389217_LongDesc,A legendary coat forged with star metal fibers woven into the fabric. It grants preternatural awareness of the waters around you.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389217_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389218_Name,Legendary Angler's Gloves
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389218_ShortDesc,Star metal fishing gauntlets
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389218_LongDesc,Gauntlets woven with star metal mesh. They grant an almost supernatural sensitivity to every vibration on the line.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389218_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389219_Name,Legendary Angler's Pants
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389219_ShortDesc,Star metal waders
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389219_LongDesc,Legendary waders reinforced with star metal plates. They make you feel rooted to the riverbed like the stones themselves.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389219_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389220_Name,Legendary Angler's Boots
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389220_ShortDesc,Star metal deep-water boots
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389220_LongDesc,"The finest boots ever crafted for an angler. Star metal soles let you walk on submerged stones as if on dry land, and the enchanted leather repels all water."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389220_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389001_Name,Wooden Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389001_ShortDesc,A crude rod made from branch and twine
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389001_LongDesc,"A simple fishing rod crafted from a sturdy branch, plant fiber, and a bone hook. It bends under even the lightest catch, but it gets the job done for a beginner."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389001_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389002_Name,Reinforced Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389002_ShortDesc,A reinforced rod with an iron reel
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389002_LongDesc,This rod features an iron-reinforced frame and a primitive reel mechanism. The improved construction allows for longer casts and greater control over the line.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389002_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389003_Name,Master Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389003_ShortDesc,A masterwork rod of tempered steel
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389003_LongDesc,"Forged by a skilled blacksmith, this rod combines a flexible steel shaft with a smooth reel. Its superior craftsmanship makes it ideal for landing the most stubborn catches in the Exiled Lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389003_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389004_Name,Legendary Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389004_ShortDesc,A rod of otherworldly craftsmanship
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389004_LongDesc,"This extraordinary rod seems to hum with latent energy. Crafted from star metal and bound with enchanted sinew, it responds to the slightest tremor beneath the water. Legends say it was once wielded by a god who fished souls from the river of the dead."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389004_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389005_Name,Jaar's Fishing Rod
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389005_ShortDesc,A rod made by the Devil itself.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389005_LongDesc,"If you have it in your hands, then you're a cheater."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389005_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389011_Name,Giant Worm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389011_ShortDesc,"A fat, wriggling worm. Stacks high."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389011_LongDesc,"A thick, squirming worm dug from the moist soil of the Exiled Lands. Not much to look at, but fish find it irresistible. Its greatest virtue is abundance, a pouch full will last many sessions."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389011_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389012_Name,Insect Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389012_ShortDesc,A common bug. Basic bait.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389012_LongDesc,"A crunchy beetle harvested from under rocks and bushes. Fish will bite, but don't expect anything special."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389012_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389013_Name,Live Minnow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389013_ShortDesc,A small live fish used as bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389013_LongDesc,"A tiny fish kept alive in a damp pouch. Predatory fish cannot resist a live, struggling meal on the hook."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389013_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389014_Name,Queen Bee
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389014_ShortDesc,A rare bee. +15% higher tier chance.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389014_LongDesc,"The queen of a hive, still buzzing with pheromones that drive fish into a frenzy. Her scent seems to attract rarer species from the depths."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389014_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389014_SecondModifier,+{0}% Rare Catch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389016_Name,Desert Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389016_ShortDesc,Forces Warm biome pool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389016_LongDesc,Sun-dried fish scales ground into a fine powder mixed with desert herbs. The arid scent draws out species normally found only in scorching desert oases.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389016_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389016_SecondModifier,Warm Biome
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389015_Name,Highlands Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389015_ShortDesc,Forces Tempered biome pool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389015_LongDesc,"A pungent mixture of tropical fish entrails and jungle nectar. When cast into any water, the scent tricks fish into behaving as if they were in warm, tropical waters."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389015_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389015_SecondModifier,Forces Temperate Biome
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389017_Name,Mountain Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389017_ShortDesc,Forces Cold biome pool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389017_LongDesc,"Frozen fish roe packed in mountain snow. The icy scent lures cold-water species to the surface, regardless of the actual water temperature."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389017_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389017_SecondModifier,Forces Cold Biome
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389018_Name,Swamp Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389018_ShortDesc,Forces Swamp biome pool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389018_LongDesc,"A foul-smelling concoction of rotting marsh plants and swamp fish guts. The putrid aroma is irresistible to the creatures that lurk in murky, stagnant waters."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389018_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389018_SecondModifier,Forces Swamp Biome
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389019_Name,Expert Bait
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389019_ShortDesc,Unlocks Legendary catches (5% max)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389019_LongDesc,A meticulously crafted lure made from rare fish organs and alchemical reagents. Only this bait can coax the legendary beasts from their hidden lairs beneath the water.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389019_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389101_Name,Fisher's Compass
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389101_ShortDesc,Reveals current biome while fishing
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389101_LongDesc,"A compact compass etched with aquatic symbols. While fishing, it reveals which biome pool your current location draws from."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389101_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389101_SecondModifier,Reveals Biome
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389102_Name,Fisher's Watch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389102_ShortDesc,Reveals current time period while fishing
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389102_LongDesc,"A battered pocket watch that still keeps time. While fishing, it displays the current period . Dawn, Day, Dusk, or Night . so you know which fish are biting."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389102_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389102_SecondModifier,Reveals Time Period
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389103_Name,Barbed Hook
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389103_ShortDesc,-50% junk fish in catch pool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389103_LongDesc,"A wickedly barbed iron hook designed to snag real fish, not old boots and branches. Having this in your pack dramatically reduces the chance of pulling up trash."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389103_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389103_SecondModifier,-{0}% Junk Fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389104_Name,Shiny Lure
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389104_ShortDesc,+15% chance of higher tier catch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389104_LongDesc,"A polished metallic lure that catches the light beneath the water. Its glimmer attracts rarer species from the depths, improving your odds of a valuable catch."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389104_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389104_SecondModifier,+{0}% Rare Catch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389105_Name,Silk Line
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389105_ShortDesc,-20% fish movement speed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389105_LongDesc,"A length of spider silk woven into fishing line. Its elasticity absorbs sudden movements, effectively slowing the fish during the mini-game."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389105_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389105_SecondModifier,-{0}% Fish Speed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389106_Name,Line Bell
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389106_ShortDesc,+15% capture zone size
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389106_LongDesc,"A tiny brass bell attached to the line. Its vibrations help you keep the fish centered, effectively enlarging the capture zone during the mini-game."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389106_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389106_SecondModifier,+{0}% Capture Zone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389107_Name,Fish Almanac
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389107_ShortDesc,Reveals fish name before mini-game
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389107_LongDesc,"A waterlogged journal filled with sketches of every species in the Exiled Lands. When you hook a fish, the almanac identifies it before the struggle begins."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389107_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389107_SecondModifier,Reveals Fish Name
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389108_Name,Lake Medal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389108_ShortDesc,Removes all junk and commun fish from pool.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389108_LongDesc,"A bronze medal awarded to master anglers. Its presence in your pack completely eliminates junk catches, only real fish will bite. Cannot be crafted; only found while fishing."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389108_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389108_SecondModifier,No Junk and Commun Fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389109_Name,Golden Scarab
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389109_ShortDesc,Chance to double your catch when you reel. Depend on the rarity of the fish.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389109_LongDesc,"A golden beetle preserved in amber, said to bring fortune to anglers. Its mere presence guarantees that every catch will be at least one tier higher than what the waters would normally offer. Cannot be crafted; only found while fishing."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389109_FirstModifier,Fishing Power +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389109_SecondModifier,Chance of Double Catch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389110_Name,Codex Piscium
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389110_ShortDesc,A leather-bound journal that records every fish you have caught.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389301_Name,Fishy Scraps
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389301_ShortDesc,Dried scraps of the most common catches
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389301_LongDesc,"Small strips cut from the flanks of the Exiled Lands' most common fish. Most anglers discard them, experienced ones don't. Something in the residual oils seems to attract curious eyes, whether swimming beneath the surface or bent over a workbench."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389302_Name,River-Caught Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389302_ShortDesc,A clean cut from a river fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389302_LongDesc,"A decent fillet from one of the calmer rivers of the Exiled Lands. The flesh is mild and firm. Nothing remarkable about it, but then, most useful things rarely announce themselves."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389303_Name,Sun-Dried Strip
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389303_ShortDesc,A thin strip dried under the desert sun
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389303_LongDesc,"Cut from a common warm-water fish and left to cure under the scorching desert sun. The process draws out the moisture and leaves something tough, stiff, and surprisingly resilient. Desert craftsmen discovered long ago that these strips, woven together, hold shape better than most leathers."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389304_Name,Scorched Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389304_ShortDesc,A fillet seared by desert heat
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389304_LongDesc,"A thick fillet from the warmer oasis waters, dried and scorched in the desert air. The bones render down into an oil that smiths prize for treating tools; it seeps into metal and leaves a faint hardness behind that no one has fully explained."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389305_Name,Spiced Oasis Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389305_ShortDesc,A rare cut seasoned with oasis herbs
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389305_LongDesc,"A choice cut from one of the rarer warm-water species, prepared with herbs found only near desert oases. The curing process releases a scent so concentrated that it lingers long after preparation, a quality that certain craftsmen exploit with great effect."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389306_Name,Gilded Desert Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389306_ShortDesc,A rich fillet from an epic warm-water fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389306_LongDesc,"A thick, golden-fleshed fillet from one of the desert's most prized catches. The rendered oil carries something almost alchemical, it doesn't simply nourish, it coaxes. Experienced bait-makers say a single drop in the right preparation can draw creatures from depths that sunlight never reaches."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389307_Name,Solar Crowned Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389307_ShortDesc,A legendary fillet glowing with warmth
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389307_LongDesc,"A cut from a creature few anglers will ever see. The flesh seems to retain warmth long after the catch, and the fibers (once rendered) carry a flexibility that no tanning process can replicate. Craftsmen who work with living wood speak of it in hushed tones."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389308_Name,Dragon-Flamed Slab
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389308_ShortDesc,A mythic slab from the Sand Dragon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389308_LongDesc,"A massive slab torn from the Sand Dragon itself. The scales embedded in the flesh catch and scatter light in patterns that seem almost deliberate; shifting, flickering, drawing the eye from impossible distances. Some say it never truly stops shining."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389309_Name,River-Scraped Strip
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389309_ShortDesc,A rough strip from a common river fish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389309_LongDesc,"A simple strip scraped from the flanks of a common highland river fish. Unremarkable on its own, but the cold river water these fish inhabit leaves the flesh dense and consistent, qualities that make it useful beyond the cooking fire."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389310_Name,River-Cured Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389310_ShortDesc,A fillet cured in highland brine
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389310_LongDesc,"A clean fillet from the temperate highland rivers, cured in mountain brine. The salt process leaves the fibers unusually tough without becoming brittle. Highland armorers have long worked this property into their craft, it layers well and holds stitching better than most."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389311_Name,Smoked Highland Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389311_ShortDesc,A rare cut smoked over highland hardwood
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389311_LongDesc,"A premium fillet from a rare highland species, smoked slowly over hardwood until the flesh is dense and deeply aromatic. The smoke binds to the oils in a way that carries on water far longer than anything else, a scent that the creatures of these rivers cannot ignore."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389312_Name,King's River Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389312_ShortDesc,An epic cut from the highland depths
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389312_LongDesc,"A thick, prized fillet from one of the great river fish of the highlands. The flesh is dense and rich, but it is the bones that craftsmen seek, unusually resonant, they carry vibration in ways that conventional materials cannot match."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389313_Name,Ancient River Slab
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389313_ShortDesc,A legendary slab from the old rivers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389313_LongDesc,"A massive cut from a legendary river creature that has haunted the highland waters for generations. The flesh is dark and ancient-tasting, but it is the rendered fat that scholars argue over, it preserves whatever it coats, indefinitely."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389314_Name,Kingly Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389314_ShortDesc,A mythic cut from the King of Rivers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389314_LongDesc,"A slab of flesh from the King of Rivers itself. Dense and dark, it carries the weight of the river's history. The bones, when dried and shaped, resonate at a frequency that craftsmen claim is unlike anything else, as if the river itself still runs through them."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389315_Name,Frozen Strip
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389315_ShortDesc,A cold strip from icy northern waters
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389315_LongDesc,"A thin strip from a fish pulled through ice into freezing air. The flesh is pale and delicate, but the cold it carries is stubborn, it doesn't leave the strip easily, even after preparation. Those who work with cold materials have found uses for that lingering chill."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389316_Name,Frost-Salted Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389316_ShortDesc,A fillet preserved in mountain frost
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389316_LongDesc,"A fillet from the cold northern waters, salted and packed in frost to preserve it. The preservation process does something unusual to the fibers; they become dense in a way that improves the action of tools worked alongside them. Northern craftsmen figured this out long before anyone else."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389317_Name,Glacial Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389317_ShortDesc,A rare cut from glacial depths
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389317_LongDesc,"A firm fillet from a rare arctic species. The cold locked into the flesh does not dissipate on its own, even after curing, it carries a chill that attracts cold-water creatures from distances that make no sense. Ice fishermen have used this for generations without ever questioning why."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389318_Name,Arctic Prime Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389318_ShortDesc,A prime cut from the deep arctic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389318_LongDesc,"A thick, prized fillet from the deep arctic fisheries. The cold has concentrated everything. The flavor, the density, the strange rigidity that sets in after curing. Materials worked with rendered arctic fat take on a hardness that standard tanning cannot achieve."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389319_Name,Permafrost Prime
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389319_ShortDesc,A legendary cut from the frozen deep
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389319_LongDesc,"A massive fillet from a legendary arctic creature. The flesh is dense and cold to the touch even after cooking, a cold that doesn't come from temperature but from something older. Armorers who work with it say the resulting material holds its shape under conditions that should destroy it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389320_Name,Leviathan Slab
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389320_ShortDesc,A mythic slab from the Ice Leviathan
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389320_LongDesc,"A slab torn from the Ice Leviathan. It radiates cold and leaves frost on whatever it touches. Weavers who have worked with thread treated in its rendered fat describe an elasticity that shouldn't be possible, it stretches without weakening, absorbs without breaking."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389321_Name,Bog-Pickled Strip
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389321_ShortDesc,A strip preserved in swamp brine
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389321_LongDesc,"A thin strip from a common swamp fish, pickled in bog water as tradition demands. Acquired taste. The murk does something to the flesh, it becomes pungent in a way that masks other scents entirely, which is occasionally useful."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389322_Name,Murk-Dried Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389322_ShortDesc,A fillet dried in swamp air
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389322_LongDesc,"A fillet from the murky swamp shallows, dried slowly in the humid air. The smell is difficult. But the dense oils it leaves behind have a penetrating quality that craftsmen working in difficult conditions have long valued."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389323_Name,Bog-Smoked Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389323_ShortDesc,A rare fillet smoked over peat
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389323_LongDesc,"A rare swamp fillet smoked slowly over peat and mangrove root. The process strips away the mud and leaves something that carries a dual nature, a dense, binding quality that craftsmen prize, and a deep, carrying scent that travels through water in ways that should not be possible."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389324_Name,Deep Mire Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389324_ShortDesc,An epic cut from the swamp depths
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389324_LongDesc,"A thick cut from one of the swamp's great predators. The flesh is dark and oily, almost too rich. Both armorers and alchemists claim it as essential to their work, and both are right, for different reasons that neither fully understands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389325_Name,Ancient Bog Slab
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389325_ShortDesc,A legendary slab from the ancient swamp
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389325_LongDesc,A massive slab from a legendary swamp creature that has survived centuries in the dark water. The flesh smells of deep time. The rendered fat preserves whatever it touches with an almost unnatural permanence.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389326_Name,Abyssal Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389326_ShortDesc,A mythic fillet from the Ancient of the Deep
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389326_LongDesc,"A slab of flesh from the Ancient of the Deep. It pulses faintly and leaves a dark, indelible stain on whatever it touches. Scholars of the deep waters have long prized this quality. Pressed against parchment, it leaves marks that no water, flame, or time can erase. What is written in that ink stays written."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389154_Name,Swamp Fishing Totem
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389154_ShortDesc,Marks this area as a Swamp fishing biome.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389152_Name,Temperate Fishing Totem
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389152_ShortDesc,Marks this area as a Temperate fishing biome.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389153_Name,Cold Fishing Totem
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389153_ShortDesc,Marks this area as a Cold fishing biome.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389155_Name,Warm Fishing Totem
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389155_ShortDesc,Marks this area as a Warm fishing biome.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389156_Name,Sand Dragon Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389156_ShortDesc,"A legendary desert trophy. The Sand Dragon surfaces only at the break of dawn, and never for the unprepared."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389156_LongDesc,"Most exiles who fish the desert never see one. Most who see one never land it. Those who do rarely speak of it, not from modesty, but because the words do not exist yet. Pre-Hyborian tablets called it the First Swimmer. You called it caught. Both things are true."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389157_Name,King of Rivers Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389157_ShortDesc,"A trophy of unmatched prestige. The King of Rivers appears only when the sun stands at its highest, and only for those who have earned it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389157_LongDesc,"There is a tradition among river fishermen: when you finally land the King, you stop for the day. Not because you have caught everything worth catching, though arguably you have, but because nothing that follows will matter much. Hang it well. It belongs on a wall, not at the bottom of a pack."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389158_Name,Ice Leviathan Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389158_ShortDesc,"A trophy from the frozen abyss. The Ice Leviathan surfaces only in the first moments of midnight, when the ice cracks and the water turns black."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389158_LongDesc,"The northern clans left offerings at the water's edge on the coldest nights. You brought a rod instead. They might have called that blasphemy. Looking at what you landed, they might also have called it effective. Mount it somewhere the cold can see it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389159_Name,Ancient of the Deep Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389159_ShortDesc,"A trophy pulled from the oldest darkness. The Ancient of the Deep was here before the swamp had a name, before the land above the water had one either."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389159_LongDesc,"The swamp tribes do not name it. To name a thing is to claim power over it, and no one holds power over the Ancient. You caught one. Whether that makes you brave, reckless, or simply lucky depends on who you ask. The Ancient did not offer its opinion."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389160_Name,Arid Moonfish Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389160_ShortDesc,A trophy from the desert night. The Arid Moonfish surfaces only when both moons are reflected in the water.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389160_LongDesc,"Desert monks kept vigil for years to document a single sighting. They wrote treatises about it. They developed entire schools of thought around whether the fish was real or mythic. You pulled one out of the water with a rod. Somewhere, a monk is very irritated about this."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389161_Name,Sand Moray Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389161_ShortDesc,"A trophy from the river shadows. The Sand Moray hunts by warmth, not sight, and it found you first."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389161_LongDesc,"Desert fishermen have one rule about the Sand Moray: never reach into a river at night. You chose to fish for one instead. The fact that you are here to hang this trophy suggests it went better than expected. The Sand Moray would disagree, but it is no longer in a position to."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389162_Name,Nocturnal Char Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389162_ShortDesc,"A trophy that belongs to the dark. The Nocturnal Char feeds only in total darkness, its scales absorb light, and the memory of catching it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389162_LongDesc,"There is something about the Nocturnal Char that stays with an angler long after the catch. Not pride, exactly. Something quieter. Like the moment you realise the dark was watching you back, and you won anyway."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389163_Name,Whiskered King Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389163_ShortDesc,A trophy of river legend. Generations tried and failed to land the Whiskered King. You did not.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389163_LongDesc,"River villages have been passing down stories of this catfish for as long as anyone can remember. Stories of the one that got away, mostly. The grandfathers of grandfathers tried. The current generation had stopped trying. Yours will not be that kind of story."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389164_Name,Frozen Sturgeon Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389164_ShortDesc,A trophy older than the kingdoms above it. The Frozen Sturgeon has outlasted every empire that ever tried to harvest it.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389164_LongDesc,"A Frozen Sturgeon carries more history in its scales than most ruins. To catch one is to briefly hold something that has watched the rise and fall of things you will only ever read about. It did not hurry for any of them. It did not hurry for you either, but here you both are."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389165_Name,Abyssal Burbot Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389165_ShortDesc,A trophy from the lightless deep. The Abyssal Burbot spent its entire existence certain that darkness was all there was.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389165_LongDesc,It came up from the black with the slow confusion of something that has never once considered the surface might exist. It still seems uncertain about this arrangement. The wall it now decorates is probably the most light it has ever encountered. It does not appear grateful.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389166_Name,Putrid Piranha Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389166_ShortDesc,"A trophy from the rot. Where its desert cousin hunts the living, the Putrid Piranha serves the dead, and its bite carries disease."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389166_LongDesc,"Swamp healers warn that a single bite will fester within hours and claim the limb within days. You managed to land the whole fish. That is either exceptional skill or exceptional luck, and the distinction matters considerably less than the result. Avoid touching the teeth when you hang it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389167_Name,Black Lamprey Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389167_ShortDesc,"A trophy of pure darkness. The Black Lamprey latches on and never lets go, except when you make it."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389167_LongDesc,"Swamp shamans use it in bloodletting rituals, claiming it draws out corruption along with blood. Whether this is medicine or superstition depends on whether the patient survives. The survival rate is not discussed. You survived catching one, which puts you in select company."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389168_Name,Ghost Fish Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389168_ShortDesc,A trophy that should not exist. Northern shamans say the Ghost Fish is not a creature of the living world. It is a soul that forgot to leave the river.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389168_LongDesc,"Most exiles who see one drifting past their line at midnight pull the line out and go home. You pulled in the fish instead. The shamans have not yet decided whether you are very brave or deeply disrespectful of the dead. Given the result, possibly both."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389169_Name,Plague Serpent Trophy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389169_ShortDesc,A trophy of wrongness. Even those who caught a Plague Serpent say the feeling of unease never entirely goes away.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389169_LongDesc,It is a creature changed by something older and fouler than the swamp itself. Exiles who have landed one and survived describe a sense of wrongness that does not fade for days. Some say it never entirely does. Mounting it on a wall means you will see it regularly. Whether that seems like a good idea is between you and your better judgment.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389327_Name,Tide-Scrap Chowder
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389327_ShortDesc,A poor catch made warm and useful.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389327_LongDesc,"Scraps of tide-caught fish are boiled down with rough herbs and whatever salt the cook could spare. It is not noble fare, but in the Exiled Lands a hot bowl can feel like mercy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389327_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389327_SecondModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389328_Name,Riverbend Skewer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389328_ShortDesc,River fish roasted for the road.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389328_LongDesc,"Skewered over coals and turned until the edges crisp, this river fish keeps the clean bite of running water. Hunters favor it when the road is long and the next fire uncertain."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389328_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389328_SecondModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_Name,Sun-Cured Trailfish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_ShortDesc,A dry ration cured under cruel sun.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_LongDesc,"Thin cuts of fish are salted and left to the desert light until they toughen into travel food. It tastes of dust, salt, and stubborn survival."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_SecondModifier,Heat Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389329_ThirdModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_Name,Scorpion Pepper Fillet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_ShortDesc,Peppered fish with a desert bite.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_LongDesc,"This fillet is rubbed with scorpion pepper until the flesh burns twice, once on the tongue and once in the blood. Desert fighters swear by it before marching into heat."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_SecondModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389330_ThirdModifier,Heat Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_Name,Mirage Oasis Cutlet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_ShortDesc,A bright cutlet steeped in oasis herbs.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_LongDesc,"Clean oasis fish is steeped with green herbs, then seared just enough to hold its juices. The taste carries the strange sweetness of water found where water should not be."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_ThirdModifier,Heat Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389331_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_Name,Dune-Gilded Feast
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_ShortDesc,A rich desert meal touched with gold.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_LongDesc,"Prepared with desert spice and a careful hand, this meal is served when a camp needs more than food. Its warmth lingers like sun on old stone."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_ThirdModifier,Heat Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389332_FourthModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_Name,Crown of the Sun Platter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_ShortDesc,A shared platter from the high desert. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_LongDesc,"Laid out like an offering to a merciless sun, this platter gathers rich fish, bronze spice, and hard-won desert craft. It is made for warriors to take strength before the heat takes them."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_ThirdModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389333_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_Name,Dragonfire Banquet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_ShortDesc,A mythic banquet of fire and spice. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_LongDesc,This banquet is built around fish cooked in fierce oils and red desert heat. The first breath over it stings the eyes; the first bite reminds exiles why they still live.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_ThirdModifier,Heat Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_Name,Riverstone Fishcakes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_ShortDesc,Crisp fishcakes from river stones.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_LongDesc,"Ground river fish is pressed with coarse meal and fried against hot stone until the edges crackle. It is simple, filling, and easy to trust."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_ThirdModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_Name,Current-Smoked Ration
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_ShortDesc,Smoked ration for hard marches.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_LongDesc,"River fish is smoked low and slow until the flesh darkens and tightens into a soldier's ration. It carries well, eats clean, and leaves the hands smelling of old campfire."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_SecondModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_ThirdModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_Name,Highland Ember Cut
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_ShortDesc,A mountain cut finished over embers.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_LongDesc,This thick cut is rested near the coals until smoke and heat work into the flesh. It is the sort of meal eaten in silence after climbing too far to complain.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_ThirdModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_Name,Royal River Portion
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_ShortDesc,A noble portion from clean current.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_LongDesc,"Selected from the finest river catch, this portion is cooked gently and dressed with clear herbs. Even in exile, some meals remember the table manners of kings."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_ThirdModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_Name,Elder Current Feast
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_ShortDesc,A shared feast of old river ways. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_LongDesc,"Laid for a full camp, this feast follows the old river custom: first portion to the blade, second to the hand that rows, third to the one who keeps watch."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_ThirdModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_FourthModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_Name,Sovereign River Banquet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_ShortDesc,A mythic banquet fit for river-kings. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_LongDesc,"Prepared as if for a drowned court, this banquet piles prime river fish with bright herbs and strong broth. Those who eat from it carry the current in their limbs."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_ThirdModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_FourthModifier,Stamina +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_Name,Frostcamp Broth
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_ShortDesc,A warming broth for frozen camps.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_LongDesc,Fish bones and pale flesh are simmered until the broth turns rich enough to fight the cold. It is the kind of warmth a camp shares before sleep.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_SecondModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_ThirdModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_Name,Rime-Salted Steak
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_ShortDesc,Salted fish steak with a frost edge.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_LongDesc,"A firm steak is packed in rime-salt, then seared until the outside tightens and the center stays clean. It tastes sharp enough to wake the dead from snow."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_SecondModifier,Agility Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_ThirdModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_FourthModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_Name,Glacierheart Soup
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_ShortDesc,A deep soup for bitter weather.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_LongDesc,"Glacier-cold fish is cooked into a thick soup with roots, fat, and patience. It settles in the chest like a banked coal beneath ice."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_SecondModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_ThirdModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_Name,Aurora Prime Meal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_ShortDesc,A prime meal bright as winter sky.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_LongDesc,"Prepared from rare northern catch, this meal is pale, clean, and strangely luminous. Exiles say it leaves the body warmer than the bowl."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_ThirdModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_Name,Permafrost Warlord Roast
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_ShortDesc,A shared roast for frozen warbands. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_LongDesc,"This roast is carved for warriors who expect the night to be worse than the battle. Fat, smoke, and cold-water fish make it heavy enough to remember."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_SecondModifier,Follower Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_ThirdModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_FourthModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_Name,Leviathan Winter Banquet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_ShortDesc,A mythic banquet from winter depths. Lasts 20 minutes when placed.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_LongDesc,"Served in great portions, this banquet carries the taste of black water beneath the ice. It is food for those who would stare down winter and make it blink first."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_FirstModifier,Shared Feast: {0} servings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_SecondModifier,Strength Weapon Damage +{0}%
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_ThirdModifier,Cold Insulation +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_FourthModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_Name,Blackwater Pickled Bites
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_ShortDesc,Pickled bites from black water.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_LongDesc,"Small swamp fish are pickled sharp enough to cut through mud-stink and fear. The jar smells dangerous, which is usually a good sign."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_FirstModifier,Prepared Fish Dish
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_SecondModifier,Armor +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_ThirdModifier,Health +{0}
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_Name,Mire-Dried Field Ration
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_ShortDesc,A dried ration for mire patrols.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/JaarFishing/DT_Fishing_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_LongDesc,"Mire fish is dried hard, smoked lightly, and wrapped for travel through wet country. It is ugly food, but it does not betray you."
