ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999127_LongDesc,"A simple wooden chest set aside for provisions. Thralls of an Ironlight settlement only eat from feeding vessels: thrall pots, preservation boxes and food chests like this one."
