ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999129_LongDesc,A market stall where a crafter thrall sells goods to visitors. The shopkeeper's skill level decides the stock. Earnings are stored in the stall.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999130_ShortDesc,Market stall
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999130_LongDesc,A market stall where a crafter thrall sells goods to visitors. Earnings are stored in the stall.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999131_ShortDesc,Market stall
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999131_LongDesc,A market stall where a crafter thrall sells goods to visitors. Earnings are stored in the stall.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999132_ShortDesc,Citizen Order
