ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999133_LongDesc,A simple wooden chest for the town's food supplies.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999134_LongDesc,"Marks a household for your settlement. Assigned residents claim their own beds nearby, keep them, and return home to rest."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999137_Name,General Merchant Stall
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999137_ShortDesc,A market stall where a merchant thrall buys raw resources for silver
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_999137_LongDesc,"Assign a thrall to this stall and it will buy bulk raw resources - stone, wood, ore and more - for silver coins. The goods go to the town treasury."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Founding_Title,Ironlight: Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Founding_Desc,"Your thralls can live a life of their own. Found a town, give its people a home, and watch it come alive."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Founding_Prereq,Reach level 10
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Training_Title,Ironlight: Training
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Training_Desc,"Strength is made, not found. Build training grounds and let your citizens grow stronger day by day."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Training_Prereq,Complete Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Feeding_Title,Ironlight: Feed the Village
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Feeding_Desc,A village lives on its kitchen. Give your people a place to eat and food to eat there.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Feeding_Prereq,Complete Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Gathering_Title,Ironlight: Gather Resources
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Gathering_Desc,"Turn your town into a working economy: mark resources, build workstations and let your thralls fill the stores - even while you are away."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Gathering_Prereq,Complete Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Skills_Title,Ironlight: Skills and Careers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Skills_Desc,"From hired hands to masters of their craft: let your thralls learn a trade, grow their skill and run their own shop."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Skills_Prereq,Complete Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Logistics_Title,Ironlight: Logistics
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Logistics_Desc,Goods do not move themselves. Set up routes between your storages and let a hauler keep the town supplied.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Logistics_Prereq,Complete Founding a Town
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Schedules_Title,Ironlight: Learning Schedules
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyMerge.uexp,,IL_Journey_Schedules_Desc,"A beacon can hold more than one job. Teach your citizens a daily routine - where to stand, how long to stay, and when not to be interrupted."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_1_Title,Lay the Foundation
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_1_Desc,"Every town starts with a heart.<br><br>Craft a Town Center and place it on open, walkable ground."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_2_Title,A Place to Belong
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_3_Title,First Hands
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_4_Title,A Bed of Ones Own
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Found_5_Title,Lights Out
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Train_1_Title,Grounds for Growth
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Train_1_Desc,Build and place a Training Beacon.<br><br>It marks where your citizens go to grow stronger.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Train_2_Title,Tools of the Trade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Train_2_Desc,Build and place a Training Mat.<br><br>Other training stations work for daily training as well - but this step looks for the mat.
