ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ironlight-Core/IL_DT_JourneyStepsMerge.uexp,,IL_IL_Train_4_Desc,Wait and watch: your thrall trains on their own and levels up Vitality.<br><br>Time and sweat do the rest.
