ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/NightTerrors/DataTables/DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344600_ShortDesc,"Swords crafted from a dull, grey metal, radiating intense heat, and balanced for dual wielding. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/NightTerrors/DataTables/DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344600_LongDesc,"Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, these weapons have an unnatural and disconcerting feeling.These swords have been perfectly balanced for the purpose of wielding both of them at the same time, sacrificing defense in favor of a flurry of blows being rained down on your opponent."
