ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/NightTerrors/DataTables/DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable.uexp,,DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344601_LongDesc,"Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural and disconcerting feeling.
 
Great swords are faster than many other two-handed weapons, and their great reach makes them ideal for fending off groups of opponents."
