ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/PvEPlusAmbush/UI/MultiUserWidget/W_Ambush_AdminOptions.uexp,,3256AFE14354369B9DF32E9406576A10,"Minimum Time Between Ambushes: {LineBreak}     * This represents the minimum amount of time between ambushes.  {LineBreak}     * Enter in seconds. (ex. 1200 = 20 mins (1200/60)) {LineBreak}{LineBreak}Maximum Extra Time Between Ambushes:{LineBreak}    * This represent the additional amount of random time between ambushes.  This allows you to randomize the ambush clock.{LineBreak}    * Enter in seconds. (ex. 600 = 10 mins(600/60)){LineBreak}{LineBreak}Minimum Spawn Distance:{LineBreak}    * This is a base minimum number for spawn closeness.  The spawner will choose a random distance between the max and min.{LineBreak}    * Choose a slider point, the lower the number the closer the spawn.{LineBreak}    * Note: Setting this number below 20 may result in NPCs spawning right on top of you, pinning you in a position where you cannot move.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Max Spawn Distance:{LineBreak}     * This is a base maximum for spawn distance.  The spawner will choose a random distance between the max and min.{LineBreak}     * Choose a slider point, the lower the number the closer the spawn.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Ambush Warning Time:{LineBreak}     * This represents the amount of time between the ambush horn and NPCs spawning in.{LineBreak}     * Enter in seconds.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Minimum Number of Enemies:{LineBreak}    * The least amount of enemies that can spawn during a single ambush spawn.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Maximum Number of Enemies:{LineBreak}    * The maximum amount of enemies that can spawn during a single ambush spawn.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Enable Ambush Despawner: {LineBreak}     *Despawns ambush spawned enemies after a period of time. {LineBreak}{LineBreak}Ambush NPC Despawn Time: {LineBreak}     *Will despawn enemies after the time has expired. Time is in seconds. {LineBreak}{LineBreak}Enable 'Exile Lands' Enemies:{LineBreak}     * Enabling this toggle will allow enemies unique to the 'Exile Lands' map to spawn.{LineBreak}     * For example, Frost Giants, Yetis, and Sandbeasts.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Enable 'Isle of Siptah' Enemies LineBreak}     * Enabling this toggle will allow monsters unique to the 'Isle of Siptah' map to spawn.{LineBreak}     * For example, Devolved monsters, Bigfoot, and Fiends.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Enable 'Maelstorm' Specific Monsters Found on 'Isle of Siptah':{LineBreak}     * Enabling this toggle will allow monsters unique to the 'Maelstorm' event found on the 'Isle of Siptah' map to spawn.{LineBreak}     * For example, Doels, Ghouls, and Blood Defilers.{LineBreak}{LineBreak}Enable Enemy Multiplier Curve Above Level 60:{LineBreak}    * Use this toggle to increase the number of enemies that will spawn the higher the player gets above level 60"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/PvEPlusAmbush/UI/MultiUserWidget/W_Ambush_AdminOptions.uexp,,89320357490A57AED78A2B924B799954,Makes the Additional Ambush setting require a defined number of players on the server in order to work. 
