ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,CBE3E5C94E04863AAA2AA3AB107D75E1,A combined hood and headcloth designed for a desert environment to protect the wearer from sand and heat.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,2550DC954E5202A3CF0DC2A23206CA07,"A combination hood and headcloth typically seen on nomadic tribesmen traversing the vast Stygian deserts to protect against severe heat and sandstorms. This piece is quite unique and seems to have the unusual ability to resist even the most radical of hot temperatures while at the same time allowing the user to breathe freely during sandstorms. Adding to these abilities and although light in weight, it also provides a decent armor rating matching much heavier items."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,4A8C13124002B350197F6A9041F951F9,Medium Armor
