ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991104_FourthModifier,Pacifying
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51420_Name,Grey One Mask
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51420_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One

It is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.

This mask is a gruesome attempt to mimic the face coverings worn by the Grey Ones. It is not as fear inducing as the presence of the creatures themselves, but it captures the eerie diabolism of their features."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51421_Name,Grey One Shoulders
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51421_ShortDesc,A bone shoulder armor made to imitate the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51421_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One

It is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.

Despite their name, these shoulderpads have little to do with the Grey Ones and seem to be more of a human admirer?s attempt to replicate their bizarre coverings."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51422_Name,Grey One Armbands
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51422_ShortDesc,A pair of armbands made to imitate the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51422_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One

It is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.

Despite their name, these armbands have little to do with the Grey Ones and seem to be more of a human admirer?s attempt to replicate their bizarre coverings."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51423_Name,Grey One Kilt
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51423_ShortDesc,A kilt made to imitate the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51423_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One

It is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.

The devils themselves prefer to walk naked, with only their faces covered by grotesque masks. Whovever made this kilt, however, was clearly human and has attempted to include the elements necessary for human decency."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51424_Name,Grey One Footwraps
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51424_ShortDesc,A pair of footwraps made to imitate the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_51424_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One

It is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.

Despite their name, these footwraps have little to do with the Grey Ones and seem to be more of a human admirer?s attempt to replicate their bizarre coverings."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_Name,Axe of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_ShortDesc,An axe made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_LongDesc,"This axe is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Axes are a difficult weapon for inexperienced warriors, due to their smaller surface area and uneven balance. No other one-handed weapon shares their raw power, and they can wreak havoc on unarmored foes."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_ThirdModifier,Bonus Vitality
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_FourthModifier,Set's Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991106_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_Name,Mace of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_ShortDesc,A mace made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Under the ebon skin long, rounded muscles rippled, and Conan did not doubt that the monster could rend an ordinary man limb from limb. The nails of the fingers provided further weapons, for they were grown like the talons of a wild beast.</> - The Pool of the Black One

This mace is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Capable of shattering bones through armor and crumpling helmets, the mace is a preferred weapon against heavily armored foes, bypassing the protection of their armor through sheer force."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_FirstModifier,High Grade
