ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_Name,Sword of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_ShortDesc,A sword made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_LongDesc,"This sword is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Swords are straight-bladed, one-handed weapons, both fast and reliable."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_ThirdModifier,Bonus Vitality
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_FourthModifier,Set's Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991108_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_Name,Great axe of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_ShortDesc,A great axe made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_LongDesc,"This greataxe is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

A weapon that combines the razor edge of the Great Sword with the momentum and weight of the Warhammer, the Great Axe is a vehicle of savagery and slaughter.

The brutish strength required to swing the weapon with any degree of accuracy means that the weapon is rarely wielded by commoners. More often it is reserved for the ceremonial guards of kings where it is used to convey power and presence."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_ThirdModifier,Bonus Vitality
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_FourthModifier,Set's Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_Name,Warhammer of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_ShortDesc,A warhammer made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_LongDesc,"This hammer is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Mauls and warhammers are slow to swing and leave their user vulnerable to counterattack, but when they connect they are brutally effective. Armored foes are particularly vulnerable to these massive blunt weapons which break bones, shatter skulls and crush spines."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_SecondModifier,Weapon
