ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991110_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991111_Name,Great Sword of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991111_ShortDesc,A greatsword made in imitation of the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991111_LongDesc,"This great sword is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Great swords are faster than many other two-handed weapons, and their great reach makes them ideal for fending off groups of opponents."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991111_FirstModifier,High Grade
