ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991112_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991113_Name,Daggers of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991113_ShortDesc,A pair of daggers made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991113_LongDesc,"These daggers are clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

Capable of cutting and dicing, slashing and slaying, daggers are for those who like to get in close and wreak havoc, then move to a safe distance while their foes bleed out."
