ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991114_Name,Katana of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991114_ShortDesc,A katana made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991114_LongDesc,"This katana is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

A more interesting question lingers - katanas are a staple of far eastern land of Yamatai - how did a blade of this style end up on the Isle of Siptah?"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991114_FirstModifier,High Grade
