ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991115_Name,Spear of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991115_ShortDesc,A spear made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991115_LongDesc,"This spear is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

With superior reach the spear is a common weapon on the battlefields of Hyboria. The most effective use of the spear is from behind the lines of battle, thrusting into the gaps in a shield wall.

The thick haft and weighted end mean that the spear must be wielded in two hands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991115_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991115_SecondModifier,Weapon
