ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_Name,Shortsword of the Grey Ancients
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_ShortDesc,A shortsword made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_LongDesc,"This shortsword is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

The distinction between a dagger and a shortsword is blurry at best. The topic has been of much speculation among the smiths of Ahkbitan for many, many years - often discussed over tankards of ale in backwater taverns.

The conclusion of those drunken debates is this - if you'd use it to eat a meal or slit a throat, it qualifies as a dagger or knife - if you'd use it to stab somebody in the face, it is probably a shortsword."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_ThirdModifier,Bonus Vitality
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_FourthModifier,Set's Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991117_FifthModifier,Bonus Grit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_80718_Name,Grey One Banner
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_80718_ShortDesc,A banner marking the presence of the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_80718_LongDesc,Any semi-permanent camp in the Exiled Lands and beyond needs a banner. It serves to warn off foes - or entice them.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991105_Name,Sacred Eldarium
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991105_ShortDesc,A blessed piece of composite Eldarium
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991105_LongDesc,"Composited and reforged from religious ingredients, this ingot is workable when heated but the final form must be heat treated with serpent blood and blessed by stygian high priests before being used.This unusual material is strange to the touch and seems to vibrate with a resonating hum. The combination of its ingredients results in this sacred bar only known to the highest of stygian priests and its recipe is guarded most secretly. It is said Thoth-Amon himself uncovered the metallurgy while delving into forbidden Acheronian knowledge, but that is only a myth told among the stygian high priests, or is it?"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991105_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991105_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991118_Name,Altar of Tranquility
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991118_ShortDesc,A station that calms even the most stubborn of souls.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991118_LongDesc,This altar is based on an ancient Acheronian magical design that was used to inter and tame captive sorcerers to either drain their essence or turn them into loyal servants. It has the unique ability to quickly pacify the mind of any mortal and convert them into a loyal follower. Its compact stature makes for a discrete station in order to minimize impact upon surrounding environs.
