ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_Name,Blessed Forge of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_ShortDesc,A special forge for smelting unique resources.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_LongDesc,This ancient forge is blessed by the old serpent god – Set. It burns so hot that it can smelt down the toughest of unique resources. Legends say that the recipe to create it were stolen by a group of Acheronian spies who infiltrated into the depths of the volcano. The myth says that only one of the spies escaped capture by the serpent men to tell the tale. It is said that the serpent men have the only other comparable device deep in the depths of the volcano. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_FirstModifier,Blessed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_SecondModifier,Ancient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991127_ThirdModifier,Scorched
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_Name,Smelting Furnace of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_ShortDesc,A unique smelting furnace designed to minimize resources melted down and maximize their output
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_LongDesc,"This unique smelting furnace has special properties that allows the user to put the minimum number of raw resources into it resulting in a maximum yield as a result. Be it godly means of Set, or their sorcery, this station reduces waste, lowers cost of base materials and nets more refined resources. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_FirstModifier,Reduced Craft Time
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_SecondModifier,High Yield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991128_ThirdModifier,Reduced Resources
