ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991129_ShortDesc,A stuffed and mounted Bronze Dragon head
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991129_LongDesc,The Exiled Lands is filled with fearsome creatures and every encounter is a matter of life and death. This souvenir commemorates a battle where one tough SOB triumphed.
