ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991133_ShortDesc,A Special Tincture to Heal Wounds
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Mines_of_Set/Tables/Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table.uexp,,Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991133_LongDesc,The land of Stygia is filled with many wonders as well as many dangerous animal & plant species. The Set priests carry this magical tincture with them to quickly heal wounds in case they encounter the latter. Ingesting this gives the user an extraordinary healing effect. Best to keep a few on oneself at all times.
