ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693026_FirstModifier,Insulated
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_Name,Irukian Column
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_ShortDesc,A column made of cut stone blocks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_LongDesc,"Columns offer stability to tall structures, allowing height to become a significant factor in building. Be aware, however, that columns also offer a unique weak point for enemies to attack.Built of close fitting bricks of cut stone reinforced blocks will provide a safe haven from the weather and strong front to any foes who come knocking."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_FirstModifier,Insulated
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_Name,Irukian Battlement Wall
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_ShortDesc,A low battlement wall made of cut stone blocks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_LongDesc,"This low wall battlement is not designed to keep enemies out, but rather to provide defensive archers with a measure of cover between shots. Built of close fitting bricks of cut Stonebrick, reinforced by wooden slats that have been shaped to fit, this will provide a safe haven from the weather and strong front to any foes who come knocking."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_FirstModifier,Insulated
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_Name,Irukian Corner Wall Trim
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_ShortDesc,A special corner wall trim made of cut stone blocks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_LongDesc,"Laid out by the master mason, the precision cut wall corner stones anchor masonry walls in a building. These add a finished trim to the wall corners of Irukian styled architecture."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_FirstModifier,Insulated
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693030_Name,Irukian Wedge Foundation
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693030_ShortDesc,A triangular wedge foundation made of cut stone blocks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Shemite_City_State/DT/Shemite_CS_Item_Table.uexp,,Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693030_LongDesc,"It is said that a building is only as good as its foundation. Foundations provide the essential stability to anything built atop them and prevent the growth of plants beneath them.Placing a foundation is a significant act in the Exiled Lands. Once a foundation is placed by a clan or individual, that land is considered their territory. Nobody else can build in the immediate area unless the foundation is destroyed.Cut stone masonry is a time-tested building material that is traced back generations – even to the time of Atlantis. It provides a sense of permanence and scale fortifying a base against all but the strongest of siege weapons or cunning invaders. The specific architectural style emulates the light-colored masonry found in the great Shemite City-State of Iruk."
