ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012421_Name,Ymir's Swordbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012421_ShortDesc,An ancient and highly-advanced gladius marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012421_LongDesc,"Traditionally used as an offhand parrying weapon with its special centerline slit, it is equally as deadly as a sword weilded by the trained warrior. Short swords are prized in Hyborian cultures for their ability to thrust and stab in tight spaces where no longer weapon could ever be wielded. This weapon has been blessed by the frost giant god Ymir and has been known to break the skull as much as an opponent's sword! "
