ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_Name,Polar Bear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_ShortDesc,A summoned beast of Aesirian lore
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_LongDesc,"The Aesir view bears as the forefather of man. Aesirian lore views the bear as a symbol of inner strength, wisdom and healing. In particular, the female bear is seen as compassionate family-driven and fiercely protective beast. While the male bear is primarily associated with strength. Their gods are even known to take on the shape of a bear when visiting the human world. Polar bears have their own unique meanings and attributes in Aesirian culture. Adapted to a cold environment and blending into their surroundings, they are adept hunters and can easily outrun and outswim humans. It is said that Ymir himself is accompanied by two great polar bear companions. Legend tells of the northern most Aesirian clans being able to raise young cubs into mighty followers able to crush the toughest of their enemies."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_FirstModifier,Pet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_SecondModifier,Beastly
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012433_ThirdModifier,Blessed by Ymir
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012434_Name,Aesirian Hauberk
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012434_ShortDesc,A chestpiece crafted in ancient Aesrian style
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012434_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic""> “Then suddenly the borealis, the snow-clad hills and the blazing heavens reeled drunkenly to Conan’s sight; thousands of fire-balls burst with showers of sparks, and the sky itself became a titanic wheel which rained stars as it spun. Under his feet the snowy hills heaved up like a wave, and the Cimmerian crumpled into the snows to lie motionless.” </> - The Frost-Giant’s Daughter By Robert E. Howard. This chest armor is of ancient aesirian origin and bears an old script in archaic motifs only deciphered by the eldest of Aesir cheiftans.Traditionally, a tunic of chain mail worn as defensive armor, the hauberk is a formidable defense from any type of attack. This heavy armor piece is substantial in weight causing the wearer to sacrifice some mobility."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012434_FirstModifier,Heavy Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012435_Name,Aesirian Chausses
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012435_ShortDesc,Leg armor crafted in ancient Aesrian style
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012435_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic""> “In a cold dark universe, whose sun was extinguished eons ago, Conan felt the movement of life, alien and unguessed. An earthquake had him in its grip and was shaking him to and fro, at the same time chafing his hands and feet until he yelled in pain and fury and groped for his sword.” </> - The Frost-Giant’s Daughter By Robert E. Howard. This leg armor is of ancient aesirian origin and bears an old script in archaic motifs only deciphered by the eldest of Aesir chieftains.Chausses offer flexible protection effective against slashing and piercing weapons when paired with a hauberk creating a formidable overall defense against just about any kind of attack. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012435_FirstModifier,Heavy Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012436_Name,Aesirian Helm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012436_ShortDesc,Helmet armor crafted in ancient Aesrian style
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012436_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic""> “He’s coming to, Horsa,” said a voice. “Haste - we must rub the frost out of his limbs, if he’s ever to wield sword again.” “He won’t open his left hand,” growled another. “He’s clutching something - “Conan opened his eyes and stared into the bearded faces that bent over him. He was surrounded by tall golden-haired warriors in mail and furs. “Conan! You live!”</> - The Frost-Giant’s Daughter By Robert E. Howard. This helm is composed of a metal mask and the hood of an ancient Aesirian shaman. Traditionally, the Aesir wear crude steel helmets, but this piece paired with other Aesirian armors displays a foreboding aesthetic sure to disturb even the hardest of foes. Perhaps that’s part of its charm?"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012436_FirstModifier,Heavy Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Ymirs_Respite/Data_Tables/ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite.uexp,,ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012437_Name,Aesirian Gauntlets
