ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,D5756D1D48FEA4F0B3F1599DCCCA9205,Obtain religious equipment
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,3C3CCA9F47436651CDEF11A94B8B047E,"Items with special effects are marked with a small 'EoT' logo in their icon's corner. These items can empower your combat with special magical effects.

Craft a religious EoT item at an altar or loot one from a dead priest."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,CE20D5884872F7E1D77D969BA291A6D2,Gain a religious boon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,D214AFC04AE1D7F1A323F496EC8A755F,"Equip a religious weapon or wear at least three pieces from the same religious armor set to gain a special bonus power in combat.

The specifics for each bonus can be read in each item's long description (the ""More Info"" button)."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,C28304774FB85BB8695451B7D088B1B2,Use your new power in battle
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,A8066DD342C85FA1AA0EBA8C88E4E706,"Trigger a religious weapon effect or armor set bonus in combat. Most of them can be activated by melee or ranged attacks, see the long description of your item for details.

These special combat bonuses typically deal one of the five new magic damage types. Mouse over the new icons on your character sheet for more information."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,86C525F8DF157E71B4840F94DF157E71,"Kill a priest to draw the attention of their god, summoning several waves of increasingly difficult religious zealots. Defeat them all for a reward.

As you level up you'll unlocked more powerful tiers of Invocations, providing greater challenges and rewarding greater loot.

Even low-tier Invocations are a substantial challenge early in the game and you don't have to defeat this one to progress the journey."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Journey/EoT_DT_JourneySteps_Add.uexp,,E62471A847DF3F4024DD5BB3C11FE111,Obtain an Orb of Desecration. These profane throwing orbs let you force an invocation at certain religious sites when you are ready.
