ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_ShortDesc,An ornate mask worn by Setite devotees.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Gold and scale, fang and tribute: the servants of Set learned that devotion was not always hidden in shadow. Sometimes it gleamed on the skin, bright enough to invite a knife.</>

This mask is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Set.

<LoreItalics>Blood Tribute: While wearing a Setite armor set, dealing or taking damage can consume Blood from your inventory to increase your Sanguine damage by up to 10%. Killing a human empowers your next attack with bonus Sanguine damage and Sibilant Poison.</>

<LoreItalics>Sanguine magic damage sometimes deals a burst of true damage based on the target's missing health, healing you if the burst kills them.</>"
