ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51995_Name,Headdress of Jhebbal Sag
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51995_ShortDesc,A skull headdress worn by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51995_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Before fang and hand forgot their kinship, before men named themselves apart from beasts, all living throats knew the same cry. Jhebbal Sag ruled that first dark tongue, and those who wear his sign remember the old law: hunt, bleed, and answer blood with blood.</>

This headdress is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.

<LoreItalics>Primal Bloodletting: Your attacks often apply Savage Wounds, causing the target to bleed for 20 true damage over 20 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. When Savage Wounds reaches 20 stacks, the bleed is consumed and you gain Frenzy for 10 seconds, increasing your attack speed and stamina regeneration by 30%.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51995_FirstModifier,Hallowed Light Armor
