ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51855_ShortDesc,A macabre weapon of bone fused to rock.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51855_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Yog is lord of the empty places: the desert where voices die, the ruin where no hearth burns, the black gulf between the stars. His faithful carried weapons for their oldest commandment: eat no green thing, and let no meat go unclaimed.</>

This cudgel is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Yog.

<LoreItalics>Gnawing Hunger: Your direct weapon attacks can trigger Gnawing Hunger, dealing up to 90 Entropic damage based on the target's remaining health. The effect is strongest against a fresh target and fades sharply as the target approaches death.</>

<LoreItalics>Entropic magic damage sometimes amplifies all physical damage taken by the target for a short while.</>

<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51855_FirstModifier,Hallowed
