ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_Name,Glacier-Crack
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_ShortDesc,A black-ice axe humming with frigid power.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Ymir's faithful carried the north in their hands: frost on the iron, laughter in the teeth, and the courage to meet the storm face-first. Their weapons rang with the old joy of battle, bright as ice under a hard winter sun.</>

This axe is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Ymir.

<LoreItalics>Cracking Glacier: Your attacks grant Frost Fracture for 12 seconds, stacking up to 10 times. Kicking consumes all Frost Fracture to deal 30 Primal cold damage per stack to enemies in a line in front of you, up to 300 damage at 10 stacks.</>

<LoreItalics>Primal magic damage sometimes puts a stacking damage-over-time debuff on your target that deals more Primal damage and can stack from its own damage. Each of the four elements stacks separately.</>

<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_SecondModifier,Cracking Glacier
