ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51634_Name,Zathite Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51634_ShortDesc,Ceremonial daggers used by Zathite priests.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_51634_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>The Zathites saw decadence as a sickness and venom as its cure. In Yezud, beneath the gaze of the eight-eyed idol, weapons were blessed for a single purpose: to open the impure world to the spider-god's judgment.</>

This pair of daggers is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Zath.

<LoreItalics>Zathite Anathema: Your attacks often apply Purifying Venom to you and your target, dealing 8 Radiant damage per stack over 16 seconds. You gain 1 stack, while the target gains stacks equal to your current total. Upon reaching 15 stacks, your venom is removed and you gain 8% Radiant Amp and Agility weapon damage for 30 seconds. Purifying Venom cannot be applied again for 32 seconds.</>

<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>

<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
