ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210119_LongDesc,"A lightweight orb filled with... something. It feels like it would be effortless to throw a great distance. Upon contact, the orb creates a steady radiant glow where it hits that lasts for a long time. Perfect for spreading Mitra's scripture to the darkest reaches of the earth."
