ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ItemTable_53651_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Better if steel and bowstring prevail without further aid from the arts, for the constant use of mighty spells sometimes sets forces in motion that might rock the universe.</> - The Hour of the Dragon

A well-made arrow can be the difference between a hit and a miss.

Arrows can be equipped by dragging them over the bow in the inventory."
