ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_ShortDesc,Fuel for your body is fuel for your wrath
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_LongDesc,"The Lord of Empty Abodes craves sustenance. Your sustenance. Feed this infinite appetite and your victory is assured.

<LoreItalics>Drinking this causes your attacks to consume up to 30% total food to deal bonus Entropic damage when you attack for 40 seconds. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_SecondModifier,Depletes Hunger
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_ThirdModifier,Boosts Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_Name,Torment Infusion
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_ShortDesc,Liquid flirtation with death and ecstasy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_LongDesc,"Everything you consider pleasurable is another's idea of suffering. Everything you consider unpleasant is another's secret shameful rapture.

<LoreItalics>Drinking this grants you infinite stamina and causes your attacks to lifesteal for 30% of damage dealt and deal 10% bonus damage as Astral damage. While active you lose 8% of your maximum health every second. Lasts 30 seconds. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_FirstModifier,Hallowed
