ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Merge_18303_ShortDesc,A holy food served at the orgies of Derketo
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_18303_FirstModifier,Feast
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_18303_SecondModifier,Stamina Regen
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_18303_ThirdModifier,Debauchery
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_Name,Honeyed Dates of Derketo
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_ShortDesc,A tasty treat for your faithful
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_LongDesc,"Said to be the fruit of Derketo's personal domain, this sweet fruit is an ideal reward and motivator to those in your service. What you don't tell them is that the fruit is blessed to compel further obedience and submission from them. A servant who is fed these special dates will come to view their Master or Mistress with an overwhelming lustful desire that inspires effort beyond their normal ability in the silent hope of being chosen for the bed chambers.

<LoreItalics>When fed to thralls, grants them +20% strength and agility weapon damage and +300 armor for 1 hour. Counts as an elixir buff.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_SecondModifier,Buffs Thralls
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_ThirdModifier,+20% damage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_FourthModifier,+300 armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_Name,Stalwart Infusion
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_ShortDesc,A frigid bottle of pure will to live
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_LongDesc,"Few know true hardiness in adversity like Ymir's faithful do. No matter how harsh the blizzard, how tall the mountain, how bitter the chill, they find a way. So will you.

<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to cripple and causes you to rapidly heal when below 30% maximum health for 1 min. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_SecondModifier,Cripple Immunity
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_ThirdModifier,Heals When Low
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_Name,Rubric Infusion
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_ShortDesc,A bottle with perfectly ground facets filled with an odorless poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_LongDesc,"The venom is deadly, yes. But it is so much more than that if only one studies it correctly. There is symmetry in its agony. Patterns in the suffering. Divine cleansing in its infliction.

<LoreItalics>Drinking this causes your attacks to apply Rubric Venom to the target for 48 seconds. Rubric Venom lasts 16 seconds, deals Entropic damage, stacks up to 24 times, and cannot be cleansed. Whenever the stacks reach a multiple of 8 (8, 16, 24) a burst of Radiant damage is dealt to all nearby enemies, increasing each time. When Rubric Venom reaches 24 stacks it ends. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_SecondModifier,Poison Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_Name,Fury Infusion
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_ShortDesc,A pungent flask blessed by Jhebbal Sag
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_LongDesc,"Drink deeply and remember your true nature, human. Remember what you were meant to be. Shed your meekness and hunt.

<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to stagger and grants you 500 armor for 40 seconds. Every 8 seconds your next attack is empowered with 30% bonus armor penetration and deals bonus Primal earth damage. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_SecondModifier,Stagger Immunity
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_ThirdModifier,Bonus Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_FourthModifier,Empowered Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_Name,Webweaver Arrow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_ShortDesc,Arrows wrapped with blessed spider silk
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_LongDesc,"These arrows are wrapped with threads drawn from sacred offerings, primed to cling and coil where they strike. Where the arrow lands, silk spreads across stone and wood alike, turning bare walls into the spider’s highway.


<LoreItalics>Webweaving: Your shots create a sticky spider web where they land, increasing climbing speed for any player who climbs on them. Lasts 60 seconds.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_SecondModifier,Webweaving
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210133_Name,[DEP] Sigil of the Sun
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210133_ShortDesc,This item still works but is being phased out
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210133_LongDesc,"The practice of inscribing sigils into weapons has been invented countless times by countless cultures. The exact symbols used vary across the world but their power is indisputable.

<LoreItalics>This weapon modification isn't itself a source of magic damage; instead it amplifies the damage dealt by other magical effects from weapons, armor sets, or sorcery.</>"
