ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210153_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Derketo's temples promised comfort, abandon, and the freeing of every hunger, but her acolytes knew the deeper rite. To serve the Sable Queen was to learn where breath becomes ecstasy, where ecstasy becomes offering, and where offering becomes death.</>

These anklets are part of a medium armor set worn by the faithful of Derketo.

<LoreItalics>Derketan Salacity: Spending 10 or more stamina often grants stacks of Salacity, causing your attacks to deal up to 20% bonus Astral damage and heal you accordingly. Becoming exhausted consumes Salacity and causes Backlash, making you take additional physical damage from direct attacks for 6 seconds. Salacity cannot build during Backlash.</>

<LoreItalics>Astral magic damage sometimes causes a delayed explosion, damaging enemies in an area and granting you an absorb shield based on damage done.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210154_Name,Reforged Fang-Mask of Jhebbal Sag
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210154_ShortDesc,A crested fang-mask worn by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210154_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Before fang and hand forgot their kinship, before men named themselves apart from beasts, all living throats knew the same cry. Jhebbal Sag ruled that first dark tongue, and those who wear his sign remember the old law: hunt, bleed, and answer blood with blood.</>

This fang-mask is part of a heavy armor set worn by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.

<LoreItalics>Primal Bloodletting: Your attacks often apply Savage Wounds, causing the target to bleed for 20 true damage over 20 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. When Savage Wounds reaches 20 stacks, the bleed is consumed and you gain Frenzy for 10 seconds, increasing your attack speed and stamina regeneration by 30%.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210155_Name,Reforged Scaleguard of Jhebbal Sag
