ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210169_Name,Reforged Mitraen Greathelm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210169_ShortDesc,A simple greathelm worn by Mitraen devotees.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210169_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>The servants of Mitra sought no crown of iron and no mask of terror, but walked beneath plain cloth with clear eyes and steady hearts. In the dust of exile, even humility could become a kind of armor.</>

This greathelm is part of a heavy armor set worn by the faithful of Mitra.

<LoreItalics>Martyr's Radiance: While wearing a Mitraen armor set, your attacks have a very high chance to apply Radiant Burn, dealing 18 Radiant damage over 6 seconds and healing you for the damage dealt each time it ticks. Radiant Burn stacks up to 4 times.</>

<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210170_Name,Reforged Mitraen Warcoat
