ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210289_Name,Reforged Zathite Silken Razor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210289_ShortDesc,A curved blade honed for spider-cult judgment.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210289_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>The Zathites saw decadence as a sickness and venom as its cure. In Yezud, beneath the gaze of the eight-eyed idol, weapons were blessed for a single purpose: to open the impure world to the spider-god's judgment.</>

