ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210304_Name,Epiphany Stone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210304_ShortDesc,A smooth pebble with an inscription that calms the spirit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EraOfTrials/Systems/DataTables/Religion/EoT_DT_Religious_Item_Add.uexp,,EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210304_LongDesc,"Nobody knows where this stone came from or what purpose it once served. It's inscribed with sacred geometry that makes you feel oddly calm when you gaze upon it. You sense great potential within, for good or for ill, waiting to be unlocked and used.

<LoreItalics>Epiphany stones are used for crafting certain religious and sorcerous recipes. Religious teachers may be interested in this item.</>"
