DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_Name,Preservation Box
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_ShortDesc,A cold box for preserving
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_LongDesc,"Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_Name,Improved Preservation Box
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_ShortDesc,A cold box for preserving
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_LongDesc,"Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay. This larger icebox holds more food and preserves it longer."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_Name,Dyer's Bench
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_ShortDesc,A dyer's bench for 'vat dyeing'. 
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>The man in the boat was a picturesque figure. A crimson scarf was knotted about his head; his wide silk breeches, of flaming hue, were upheld by a broad sash, which likewise supported a scimitar in a shagreen scabbard.</> - The Devil in Iron

Through the careful application of berries, bark, and beetle-guts, the artisanal dyer can transform natural fabrics and hides into an amazing array of hues and colors. Originated in Vendhya, vat dyes were so named because of the high capacity containers employed in the ancient artform."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_Name,Medium Crate
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_Name,Small Crate
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_Name,Large Crate
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_Name,Cupboard
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_ShortDesc,A shelved piece of furniture
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_LongDesc,"Often made of wood and featuring shelves and doors, cupboards are places to stow dishware or even display certain ornaments or property."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_Name,Reinforced Wooden Box
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_ShortDesc,A large wooden box for storing items
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_LongDesc,"A receptacle to store excess items and materials, this box is made from simple materials. It can be locked against strangers, but a determined thief will be able to smash it open and take what they please."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_Name,Wooden Box
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_ShortDesc,A wooden box for storing items
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this box is made from simple materials. It can be locked against strangers, but a determined thief will be able to smash it open and take what they please."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_Name,Large Chest
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_ShortDesc,A large chest for storing items
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this chest is made from sturdy materials. It can be locked against strangers, and all but the most determined thief will be deterred. No system is perfect, however."
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_Name,Vault
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_ShortDesc,A vault for storing valuable items
DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_LongDesc,"This vault, made from steel and iron, represents the most secure location to store excess items and materials. Breaking into this vault will require a heroic effort."
