ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/SevereWeatherEnhanced/DataTables/LFS_ItemTable.uexp,,LFS_ItemTable_95090_ShortDesc,A piece of eldarium-infused armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/SevereWeatherEnhanced/DataTables/LFS_ItemTable.uexp,,LFS_ItemTable_95090_LongDesc,This armor has been reforged with a core of Eldarium - which makes it stronger in every way.
