ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51091_FirstModifier,Bleed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51091_LongDesc,"The people of Yamatai trade regularly along the eastern coastline of the Thurian continent - and their dhows can be seen docked from Vendhya and Kambuja to Paikang in Khitai. They have access to purer forms of metal on their volcanic islands than many of the cultures on the main continent. 

They have developed a process called 'steel folding' that allows them to create very strong, sharp blades with a high amount of metal purity. This type of smithing is a closely guarded secret and would not be willingly taught to strangers."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51094_ShortDesc,A two-handed sword of Yamatai design
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51094_LongDesc,"The people of Yamatai trade regularly along the eastern coastline of the Thurian continent - and their dhows can be seen docked from Vendhya and Kambuja to Paikang in Khitai. They have access to purer forms of metal on their volcanic islands than many of the cultures on the main continent. 

They have developed a process called 'steel folding' that allows them to create very strong, sharp blades with a high amount of metal purity. This type of smithing is a closely guarded secret and would not be willingly taught to strangers."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51644_FirstModifier,Bleed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24214_ShortDesc,An ancient weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24214_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics> They stopped short. Conan faced them, not a naked man roused mazed and unarmed out of deep sleep to be butchered like a sheep, but a barbarian wide-awake and at bay, partly armored, and with his long sword in his hand.</> - The Phoenix on the Sword

This curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24219_ShortDesc,An ancient weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24219_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>Conan stood in the moonlit silence, the dripping sword sagging in his hand, staring down at the remnants of his enemy. The red eyes glared up at him with awful life, then glazed and set - the great hands knotted spasmodically and stiffened. And the oldest race in the world was extinct.</> - Queen of the Black Coast

This curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24219_SecondModifier,Cooling
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24168_ShortDesc,An ancient weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MoreKatanas/DataTables/MoreKatanas_ItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_24221_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics> In an instant he was the center of a hurricane of stabbing spears and lashing clubs. But he moved in a blinding blur of steel. Spears bent on his armor or swished empty air, and his sword sang its death-song.</> - Queen of the Black Coast

This curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
