ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,99255A3A49C8ED42932D9D9DD3D60B4F,"<LoreItalics>Springing to his feet, he bent his bow powerfully and drove his last shaft point blank at a great hairy shape that soared up at his throat. The arrow was a flying beam of moonlight that flashed onward with but a blur in its course, but the were-beast plunged convulsively in midair and crashed headlong, shot through and through.</> - Queen of the Black Coast

Created based on an ancient design found in the Exiled Lands, this bow seems to confuse the eye with its odd, alien curves.

In the thrum of the bowstring, it whispers of gibbering terrors screeching beneath a blood-red moon and the terrified screams of those who flee the merciless hunt.

One who holds this bow too long risks being drawn into its miasma of madness."
