ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51383_LongDesc,"Taken from the corpse of a Shaggai Huntress, this bow is of alien aspect and make. Using it is difficult, but not impossible for a human. The strange materials it is made of are slow to break and despite the strange shape of the bow, arrows seem to fly more true when fired from this bow. "
