ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_Name,Umbral Setite Mask
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_ShortDesc,A mask worn by devotees of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_LongDesc,"The dispassionate features of the serpent have been modeled and refined in this mask. It distorts the features of the wearer and brings them closer to the cold beauty of the serpents so beloved of their god.
Used primarily in rituals within the temple of Set, this mask nevertheless offers a certain level of protection for the face of the wearer."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_SecondModifier,Light
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952501_ThirdModifier,Gas Protection
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952502_Name,Umbral Setite Choker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952502_ShortDesc,A choker worn by devotees of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952502_LongDesc,"Crafted from the finest golds, this garment is light and supple. It molds pleasingly to the form and accentuates the chest. The mysteries of Set are not all blood and death - the ritual that depicts the coupling of Set with his mistress, Derketo, has been described by Mitrean scholars as ""a blasphemous orgy of wine and blood."" Though they always take the opportunity to vist any temple of Derketo during such rites. For the purposes of research, of course."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952502_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952502_SecondModifier,Light
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952504_Name,Umbral Setite Shendyt
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952504_ShortDesc,A shendyt worn by devotees of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952504_LongDesc,"Woven silk edged with golden trim has been used to shape this ornamental shendyt. Worn by devotees of Set during their rituals, these shendyts are often stained in the blood of sacrifice."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952504_FirstModifier,Hallowed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952504_SecondModifier,Light
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952505_Name,Umbral Setite Sandals
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952505_ShortDesc,A pair of sandals worn by devotees of Set
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952505_LongDesc,"These ceremonial sandals were not designed for the harsh environment of the desert, but rather the stone floors of the temple. Runnng in sand wearing these is an uncomfortable experience and fighting in them is almost impossible due to poor balance."
