ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_43001_ShortDesc,A terrifying weapon bestowed upon its wielder by a mysterious denizen of the abyss.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_43001_LongDesc,A terrifying weapon formed from some unknowable material and bestowed upon its wielder by a mysterious denizen of the abyss. This weapon will vanish if the wielder perishes.
