ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_Name,Sturdy Bone Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_ShortDesc,A bow crafted of bone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_LongDesc,This bow has been crafted from the bones of an unknown beast - the bones are strangely bendable and sturdy despite the apparent age of the bow. Whomever put this bow together prioritized sturdiness over accuracy and damage.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_Name,Feroxic Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_ShortDesc,A bow crafted from the chitinous remains of an ancient predator. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_LongDesc,"Shaped from the sturdy but remarkably sinuous spine of the extinct Feroxodon pufferfish, this compact bow generates the same relative arrow velocity as much larger weapons. 

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_Name,Featherlight Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_ShortDesc,"A bow shaped from the hollow, adamantine bones of a winged monstrosity. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_LongDesc,"Featherlight weaponry is highly sought after by those who count stealth as a professional virtue. The nearly weightless material is difficult to craft and even more difficult to wield as it lacks the heft and dimension associated with balanced weaponry. 

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_Name,Harpy's Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_ShortDesc,A bow etched with a mesmerizing swirl pattern of unfathomable depth.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_LongDesc,"The swirl pattern adorning the bow length is a form of arcane barrier trapping a demon within. While the demon is unable to communicate in any way, it still hungers for killing. To the ignorant archer, the bow seems to seek an enemy's vulnerable spots almost of its own volition. 

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_Name,Voidforge Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_ShortDesc,An ancient and highly-advanced bow marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_LongDesc,"While surface details concealed within the bow's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. 

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_FirstModifier,Ripping
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_Name,Blood-Moon Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_ShortDesc,A bow of uncertain origin
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_LongDesc,"A bow of uncertain origin, coated in the caustic gore of the Blood Moon Beast. This overgrown specimen of Moon Beast towers above even the largest of man-sized opponents and can easily swallow one whole. The beast's innards hold a veritable treasure trove of partially digested objects and even a pristine item or two. 

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51401_Name,Hunting Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51401_ShortDesc,A bow crafted from branches
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51402_Name,Hyrkanian Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51402_ShortDesc,A composite bow crafted of silk string and branches
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51403_Name,Improved Hunting Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51403_ShortDesc,A bow crafted from branches
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_Name,Powerful Hunting Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_ShortDesc,A finely crafted bow for hunting.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_LongDesc,"Carved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants. In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.

This bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the archer."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51406_Name,Ancient Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51406_ShortDesc,A bow forged from an ancient design
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51407_Name,Light Hyrkanian Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51407_ShortDesc,A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_Name,Powerful Hyrkanian Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_ShortDesc,A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_LongDesc,"This bow is made in the Hyrkanian style, using different materials to strengthen different areas of the bow and allowing it to be shorter than a longbow. For Hyrkanians, who spend most of their lives shooting from horseback, this is a necessity.

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51391_Name,Derketo's Voice
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51391_ShortDesc,A bow from the collection of the Priest King
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51391_LongDesc,"A religious item inscribed with holy runes, this relic was wrested from the undead hands of the Priest King's shade. While very accurate, this bow fires arrows with less speed than other bows, making the arrow penetrate less armor when it hits."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51391_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,ItemTable_51391_SecondModifier,Power Draw
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_Name,Bessie's Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_ShortDesc,A bow that requires great strength to draw
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_LongDesc,"In Ophir lives a pretty lass,
With hair of shining gold,
her rounded breasts and supple ass,
would make a weak man bold.

Her suitors came from all the world,
expectin' to be shunned,
But Bessie was a gen'rous girl,
She did them, every one!

All day and night they heard the cries,
Of Bessie in her bed,
And men were dropping off like flies,
She'd ridden 'em to dead.

Now came the Priest of Mitra,
And the girl he did beseech,
Stop with all this wickedness,
Just listen to me preach

But Bessie was a peacemaker,
She didn't want to fight,
She acted as a horse breaker,
And rode that priest all night.

The priest would not be beaten back,
His heart would not give way,
Though Bessie sought to drain his sack,
He'd shoot throughout the day.

And then together they each found,
The one that they had sought,
In marriage were they solemn bound,
Together they were caught.

The priest and girl they took their vow,
And shaved their hair away,
Let this be used to string a bow,
And may it shoot all day!"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_SecondModifier,Power Draw
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_Name,Frostshot
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_ShortDesc,A bow that seems to penetrate even the thickest armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_LongDesc,"There was a legend among the Nordheimers that one of the skalds was captured by a Hyperborean Witch-man. 

The skald was imprisoned in the top of a Hyperborean keep, where thick icicles hung from the ceiling and the cold northern winds would cut him directly to the bone. He was going to die, so he prayed to Ymir for help.

The Skald had just given up hope, when a flash of lightning outside the tower illuminated his room - and revealed the shape of a bow trapped inside one of the icicles.

Chipping slowly at the icicle, the Skald uncovered the wondrous bow, and shaped himself some arrows of ice from the shards.
The next time his captor came to feed him, he shot an ice arrow at the Hyperborean, expecting it to shatter on his chest. Instead, it passed through the armor and directly into the creature's heart.

The Skald escaped, and the bow went with him."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_Name,Splinter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_ShortDesc,A bow that fires arrows which always break
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_LongDesc,"A peasant from Koth was tired of mercenary troops riding across his fields on their way to war. He went out to confront them, with a simple bow made of a bent branch and arrows of simple twigs.

They laughed when he politely asked them to ride around his fields. One of them kicked him into the mud.

Humiliated, he levelled his bow at the leader. And fired. The twig flew straight and true, striking the mercenary leader in the breastplate, right above his heart.

The twig shattered, but before the mercenaries could react, a sharp splinter flew up and lodged itself it the mercenary leader's eye.

They slaughtered the peasant, of course. But the bow somehow made it to the Exiled Lands.

This bow cannot penetrate armor at all, but it does very high damage on impact."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_Name,The Huntress
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_ShortDesc,A legendary bow that boosts accuracy
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_LongDesc,"When the Lemurians fled their islands, they were captured and enslaved by the mysterious race that lived on the eastern shores of the Thurian continent.

A remnant of a remnant escaped that slavery and crossed the world in search of succor.

Thousands of people, weary and terrified, needed to be protected and fed as they crossed hostile kingdoms, ghost-haunted moors and the jungles full of dangerous creatures.

A group of women, known as Dagon's Daughters, volunteered to protect the group. They were experts with the bow, and agile fighters at close range.

This bow, simply known as The Huntress, once belonged to Dagon's Daughters."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_SecondModifier,Bonus Agility
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51586_Name,Star Metal Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51586_ShortDesc,A bow reinforced with Star Metal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51589_Name,Hardened Steel Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51589_ShortDesc,A bow reinforced with Hardened Steel
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51642_Name,Bow of the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51642_ShortDesc,A bow made in imitation of the Grey Ones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_51642_LongDesc,"This bow is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.

In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_54003_Name,Dragonbone Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_54003_ShortDesc,A bow crafted of exquisite dragonbone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92094_Name,Goat-Horn Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92094_ShortDesc,This bow has a demonic entity bound to it
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92094_LongDesc,"It is unknown as to which specific demonic entity is bound to this bow, but whichever it is, it hungers for death. A pity, then, that the entity this demon possessed was merely a goat. Otherwise, this weapon could have been quite formidable."
