ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92098_Name,Hollowbone Bow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92098_ShortDesc,A bow crafted from the bones of a winged demon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_92098_LongDesc,This bow is made from the hollow bones of the Nest Mother. Its construction is awkward yet powerful.
