ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952515_Name,Brutal Yoggite Skin Greaves
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952515_ShortDesc,Ankle wraps of soft leather
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6952515_LongDesc,"It is no secret that Darfari consume the flesh of the dead but the horrible reality of the Exiled Lands has forced them to perform other perverted acts. This includes stripping the skin from their victims to create a soft leather that can be used for crafting armor.
These leather wraps, generously called greaves, are supple leather adorned with human bones and teeth.

Light armor provides the most flexibility and range of movement in combat, but at the cost of significant protection in battle."
