ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6995916_Name,Virtuous Mitraen Circlet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6995916_ShortDesc,A simple iron circlet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/LegitReligious_Enhanced/LegitReligiousItemTable.uexp,,LegitReligiousItemTable_6995916_LongDesc,Followers of Mitra commit to a life of simplicty and dignity. They prefer knowledge to ritual and the calm of meditation to the storm of battle.This circlet reflects the simple principles of the Mitraen devout.
