ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_Name,Slaver Waistguard
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_ShortDesc,A waistguard designed to intimidate
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">There was a giant Hyperborean renegade, taciturn, dangerous, with a broadsword strapped to his gaunt frame -- for men wore steel openly in the Maul.</> - The Tower of the Elephant

In the far north, east of the lands of the Nordheimers, live the tall, gaunt people known as the Hyperboreans. Ruled by the White Hand, a cabal of sorcerers, they often stage raids into Cimmeria to take slaves for their sorcerous experiments.

It is considered a challenge among Hyperborean slavers to go bare-chested on their raids, wearing nothing more than this waistguard. While it offers less protection than steel leggings and a breastplate, it intimidates newly caught slaves into submission."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_SecondModifier,Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483018_ThirdModifier,SlaverGuard
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_Name,Slaver Loincloth
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_ShortDesc,A loincloth worn beneath by Hyperborean slavers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">There was a giant Hyperborean renegade, taciturn, dangerous, with a broadsword strapped to his gaunt frame -- for men wore steel openly in the Maul.</> - The Tower of the Elephant

In the far north, east of the lands of the Nordheimers, live the tall, gaunt people known as the Hyperboreans. Ruled by the White Hand, a cabal of sorcerers, they often stage raids into Cimmeria to take slaves for their sorcerous experiments.

Primarily worn beneath the more armored waistguard, this loincloth is designed to keep the vitals of a slaver warm and protected when on long raids in the northern lands of Asgard and Vanaheim."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_SecondModifier,Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483019_ThirdModifier,SlaverGuard
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483022_Name,Zamorian Dancer Headdress
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483022_ShortDesc,A headress favored by Zamorian temple dancers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483022_LongDesc,"Zamorians are known far and wide for the depth of their wickedness and thievery, but very few speak of the prowess of the temple dancers.
It is whispered that the temple girls of Yezud wear clothing such as this when they dance before the black stone spider that is their god.

For ceremonial usage, this headdress offers very little protection against sword or fang, but offers slight relief from cold, heat and stinging sand."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483022_FirstModifier,Legendary
