ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483020_ShortDesc,A blouse favored by Zamorian temple dancers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/MSCasaDesFlores_Weapons_Enhanced/Ma_Table/dt_Ma_Table.uexp,,dt_Ma_Table_147483020_LongDesc,"Zamorians are known far and wide for the depth of their wickedness and thievery, but very few speak of the prowess of the temple dancers.
The steps of the dance are unknown, but it is clear that it eases the black madness that whispers to those who find themselves in the vicinity of the awful presence of Zath, spider-god of Yezud.

For ceremonial usage, this blouse offers very little protection against sword or fang, but offers slight relief from cold, heat and stinging sand."
