ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790346_LongDesc,"Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.
Even the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790346_FirstModifier,Low Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790346_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790352_Name,Crushed Darkstone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790352_ShortDesc,Dark stone gravel obtained by crushing Darkstone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790352_LongDesc,"Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.
Even the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
