ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable171331_Name,Crushed Ironstone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable171331_ShortDesc,Chunks of ironstone for better melting
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable171331_LongDesc,"Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.
Even the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable171331_FirstModifier,Low Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable171331_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_Name,Dark Crystal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_ShortDesc,"Black transparent, shimmering stone"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_LongDesc,"Brittle, impossible to work with conventional tools, crystal is mostly used for focusing light and creating rudimentary lenses.
The Black Seers of Mount Yimsha craft great lenses to aid in their astrological divinations. Black sorceries gain potency when the heavens are in certain configurations."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_FirstModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_Name,Dark Mortar
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_ShortDesc,"This cold, hard artificial lava is of no further interest, unless heated in an Ancient Furnace"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_LongDesc,"The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.
However, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. 
Ichor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_Name,Molten Mortar
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_ShortDesc,"A true artificial lava, this mixture must still be molten to strengthen the Darkstone and obtain the famous Ancient Stone"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_LongDesc,"The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.
However, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. 
Ichor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_Name,Ancient Stone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_ShortDesc,Chunk of dark stone obtained by burning stone using dark powder as fuel
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_LongDesc,"Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.
Even the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_FirstModifier,Low Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_Name,Dark Wood
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_ShortDesc,Wood treated with resin
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_LongDesc,"Wood is an abundant source of fuel and building material.
Readily available and easily shaped with the right tools, wood is ubiquitous in the weapons and buildings of primitive tribes and mighty nations.

Wood allows for the creation of fire and its easy transport.

This wood has been treated with resin, making it stronger and more weather resistant."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_FirstModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_Name,Calcined Iron Bar
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_ShortDesc,Iron ingot burnt and oxidized by black powder
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_LongDesc,"The ability to work iron is a step along the road from savagery to civilization. The streets of the great cities of the world resound with the ring of hammer on anvil a song to the march of progress.
Iron weapons and armor offer superior protection, but the additional weight means carrying less supplies.
Iron can be treated with Steelfire in a Furnace to produce steel."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_FirstModifier,Mid Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_SecondModifier,Meltable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_Name,Ancient Civ Crafting Table
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_ShortDesc,A table with all the tools required for miscellaneous creations
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_LongDesc,Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_Name,Ancient Civ Grinder
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_ShortDesc,A ancient grinder to craft dark powder
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_LongDesc,"Designed to grind crystal, brimstone and coal into a fine black powder with high burning power. This powder is then used as fuel in the ancient furnace to transform stone into Dark Stone and iron bars into Calcined Iron Bar."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_FirstModifier,Low Fuel Usage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_Name,Ancient Civ Furnace
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_ShortDesc,A furnace for smelting metals and stone (required dark powder)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_FirstModifier,Low Fuel Usage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780751_Name,Ancient Civ Forge
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780751_ShortDesc,A forge with glowing lava
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_Name,Ancient Civ Stone Cutter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_ShortDesc,A bench with all the tools required to carve Dark stones
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_LongDesc,Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_Name,Ancient Civ Construction Site
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_ShortDesc,A building site for crafting construction elements
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_LongDesc,Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_Name,Ancient Civ Crane
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_ShortDesc,A useful crane for building construction elements
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_LongDesc,Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_Name,Ancient Civ Mineshaft
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_ShortDesc,A dark mineshaft
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_LongDesc,"A mineshaft can be abandoned, unless it can still be used to exploit some valuable resources."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_Name,Ancient Civ Mine Cart
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_ShortDesc,A mine cart made of wood and iron
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_LongDesc,"Often made of wood and featuring shelves and doors, cupboards are places to stow dishware or even display certain ornaments or property."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_Name,Ancient Civ Stool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_ShortDesc,A carved stone stool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_LongDesc,"Sometimes after a day of killing and slaying, all an Exile wants to do is sit down and relax.
Stools are often used as makeshift weapons in tavern brawls across Hyboria, usually hurled at an opponent in between curses."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_Name,Ancient Civ Chair
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_ShortDesc,A carved stone chair
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_LongDesc,"Commonly found only in the houses of the wealthy or noble, chairs with armrests and backs are considered a mark of refinement."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_Name,Ancient Civ Bench
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_ShortDesc,A carved stone bench
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_LongDesc,Benches like this are common in the taverns and alehouses of the world. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_Name,Ancient Civ Hanging Shelf
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_ShortDesc,A shelf for displaying objects
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_LongDesc,This simple shelf can be placed against almost any wall and used to display small objects.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_Name,Ancient Civ Table
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_ShortDesc,A rectangular carved stone table
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_LongDesc,"Tables vary in shape and size, materials and decoration based on the culture and craftsmanship of their maker.
This one is a wooden rectangle.
The artisan was probably hoping to decorate the table with dozens of interesting objects and thereby distract from the lack of imagination in the creation of the table itself."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780840_Name,Ancient Civ Table
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780840_ShortDesc,A rectangular carved stone table
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780840_LongDesc,"Tables vary in shape and size, materials and decoration based on the culture and craftsmanship of their maker.
This one is a wooden rectangle.
The artisan was probably hoping to decorate the table with dozens of interesting objects and thereby distract from the lack of imagination in the creation of the table itself."
