ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780790_Name,Ancient Civ Fireplace
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780790_ShortDesc,A crackling place of warmth and welcoming
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780785_Name,Ancient Civ Stone Throne
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780785_ShortDesc,A throne made of dark stone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780785_LongDesc,"Unlike other chairs, a throne gives the one who sits in it authority above and beyond that of an ordinary man.
Battles have always been fought for this kind of power, and they always will be.
Sitting on a throne of any kind will increase confidence and prowess for a period."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780796_Name,Ancient Civ King's Throne
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780796_ShortDesc,A throne made of dark stone
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780796_LongDesc,"Unlike other chairs, a throne gives the one who sits in it authority above and beyond that of an ordinary man.
Battles have always been fought for this kind of power, and they always will be.
Sitting on a throne of any kind will increase confidence and prowess for a period."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790314_Name,Ancient Civ Dark Stone Chest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790314_ShortDesc,A large chest for storing items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790314_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this chest is made from sturdy materials. It can be locked against strangers, and all but the most determined thief will be deterred. No system is perfect, however."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790329_Name,Ancient Civ Metal Anvil Chest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790329_ShortDesc,A large chest for storing items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790329_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this chest is made from sturdy materials. It can be locked against strangers, and all but the most determined thief will be deterred. No system is perfect, however."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780853_Name,Mug of Beer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780853_ShortDesc,A vessel for holding questionable liquids
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780853_LongDesc,"Hammered wood, banded with iron, this flagon is indistiguishable from thousands of the same found in dives and watering holes across Hyboria. A friend to cling to in dark times, a lover to kiss when lonely and a weapon to swing when the action starts, the humble flagon has seen and been everywhere."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780864_Name,Beer Foam
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780864_ShortDesc,A vessel for holding questionable liquids
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780864_LongDesc,"Hammered wood, banded with iron, this flagon is indistiguishable from thousands of the same found in dives and watering holes across Hyboria. A friend to cling to in dark times, a lover to kiss when lonely and a weapon to swing when the action starts, the humble flagon has seen and been everywhere."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780854_Name,Brown Bear Rug
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780854_ShortDesc,A rug made from a bear pelt
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780854_LongDesc,"In the gloomy hills of Cimmeria and the snow capped ranges of Vanaheim and Asgard, animal hides and furs are considered a necessity. Hide rugs are a common floor ornament considered doubly practical if the fur is left attached.
They also have a distinctive fragrance."
