ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_Name,Cub Bear Wall Pelt
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_ShortDesc,A patterned tapestry in earthen colors
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_LongDesc,"Tapestries such as this travel the Lotus road between Khitai and the Kingdoms of the West daily. Woven of plant fibers or silk, they vary in quality and quantity based entirely on the skill of the weaver and the materials used. 
That these can be made in the Exiled Lands, without a loom, is impressive."
