ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790360_LongDesc,"These large doors are designed to allow access for large groups of people in and out of safe areas. Raiders and bandits make walls a must have in the Exiled Lands and the protection afforded by gates such as these should not be taken for granted.
