ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_ItemTable.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790276_LongDesc,"Sloped rooves are practical in sandstorms as the loose debris simply runs from the roof rather than accumulating.Built of close fitting bricks of cut Stonebrick, reinforced by wooden slats that have been shaped to fit, this will provide a safe haven from the weather and strong front to any foes who come knocking."
