ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Asghaard_Ancient_Civilization/Tables/Ancient_Civ_Temp_Items.uexp,,Ancient_Civ_Temp_Items_3790319_LongDesc,"This is a wall with some stones removed to create space for a window. Useful for letting in natural light and keeping an eye on the surroundings.
