ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,B434FC7E41DA782C4ED9DD8F06D366E2,"Exquisitely woven from the finest silks, this rug boasts intricate patterns and masterful craftsmanship."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,0390D5FF45F432B528CB6EB8585E4BC9,"Its rich colors and delicate embroidery speak of wealth and refinement, offering comfort to those who seek a moment of quiet reflection. Soft beneath the hands and knees, it provides a sanctuary of serenity even in the most unforgiving lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,29BABF684345CB58AC87EF9F1BFE5902,"Soft pelts, carefully cleaned and arranged, serve as a place of rest and reflection for the devout."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,73805E9D450984E29D8AB295728F5BA9,"Warmer and more rugged than woven mats, these furs provide comfort even in the coldest nights of the Exiled Lands. Whether spread across stone floors or packed earth, they offer a touch of primal luxury to those who seek solace in quiet contemplation."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,BD43A2FD4B0E21B37FB618BCDC8470AA,"Soft pelts, carefully cleaned and arranged, serve as a place of rest and reflection for the devout."
