ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,46D6B0BA47A020B2BC516D87B0D6F390,"A finely crafted drum, its taut hide and sturdy frame designed to bring rhythm and life to any gathering."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,8E139B804E45EB8B85F39A93F3D3A087,"This well-made drum is a staple of entertainers, its deep, resonant beats capable of stirring both the soul and the body. Stretched with carefully treated hide and reinforced with a sturdy wooden frame, it is built to withstand the fervor of celebration. Whether in the hands of a skilled performer or a wandering bard, its rhythm weaves through the air, commanding dancers to move and revelers to cheer."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,1535AA704538D92F06D81E9FE8CB1EC9,"A delicate flute, its melodic tones capable of enchanting any audience"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,A309345C4299877D9B725DB54B6CA69A,"Carved from fine wood and polished to a smooth finish, this flute is the instrument of storytellers and performers alike. Its clear, lilting notes can soothe the weary, uplift the sorrowful, or inspire dancers into a whirling frenzy. Whether played by a seasoned bard or an eager entertainer, its song lingers in the air, weaving harmony into the chaos of the Exiled Lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,7BB3ACB2466091FE81751A8B8C981C88,"A long, solid bench crafted from heavy timber, worn smooth by years of use."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,BF335F0E426CBEC2097B35BC10F75394,"Its unadorned design speaks of practicality, yet there is a quiet reverence in the way it stands, inviting the weary to sit, reflect, and listen. Whether in a grand hall or a humble shrine, this pew serves as a gathering place for those who seek solace in the presence of others."
