ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,22E18BA742B5B27823082A872B053FEF,Tale of the Goatherd
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,C825BC92487B71DFE0D74C80E1B90285,"<span style=""italic"">...</>

<span style=""italic"">In the morning, Bawati saw to his great shock and dismay that his goats were rampaging over the hills, bounding over one another like fleas! He spent the whole of that day gathering them back together, and retired to his cot sore and exhausted.</>

<span style=""italic"">The next morning, as he lay there gathering his thoughts, he sat upright with the force of revelation.</>

<span style=""italic"">""The berry seeds!"" he cried.</>

- The Tale of the Goatherd

This item will teach you the Barista feat if you have not already purchased it.

To brew coffee:

1) Harvest the Desert Berry Bush and extract seeds from the berries
2) Roast the seeds at the Campfire to produce Dry Roasted Coffee Beans
3) Grind the beans to produce Coffee Grounds
4) Brew the coffee at a stove"
