ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,E4989E81436E1EBA6E8D8C8250F01887,"A small and curious baby rabbit, full of energy and innocence."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,6162D0F94A72D1C180E087A77D9A8C47,"The rabbit kit is a delightful bundle of fur, brimming with energy and innocence. Playful and inquisitive, these young rabbits spend their days exploring their surroundings, learning the ways of the world under the watchful eye of their parents. With their soft fur and twitching noses, rabbit kits evoke feelings of warmth and tenderness, reminding us of the simple joys of life. As they frolic and bound through the grass, they symbolize the beauty of youth and the promise of new beginnings in the natural world."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,A67D7C6043485D7ECD68E8853C952810,Goat
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,DE4A655440072B8FE55FCB97E0328323,A hardy and versatile creature known for its resourcefulness and climbing skills.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,A0CB3CC54B06C83FAEE341BF48FBCE96,"The goat is a resilient and adaptable animal, valued for its resourcefulness and remarkable climbing abilities. Found in various terrains, these creatures are capable of navigating rocky landscapes with ease. Goats provide valuable resources such as milk, meat, and hides, making them an indispensable asset to any homestead. Their curious nature and agility make them both a charming and practical addition to any collection of animals."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,643B63FE445434DE1F40C39662ADA91E,"A swift and graceful herbivore, known for its agility and keen senses."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,395C9750484FA14A8264699AD993308A,"The antelope is a swift and graceful creature, renowned for its agility and keen senses. Inhabiting grasslands and savannas, these herbivores are capable of impressive speeds and nimble movements, making them elusive prey for predators. Antelopes are an essential part of the ecosystem, providing both beauty and balance to the wild landscapes they roam. Their elegant horns and sleek bodies make them a striking sight, embodying the spirit of the untamed wilderness."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,BFA2A93649B0AE2E92E4609F79E2548E,"A graceful and gentle herbivore, prized for its beauty and elusive nature."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,4AA53AB8447C1222552C87A0BD0E37BA,"The deer is a symbol of grace and tranquility, known for its elegant movements and shy demeanor. Found in forests and meadows, these herbivores possess a natural beauty that captivates all who encounter them. With their slender legs and delicate features, deer embody the serene majesty of the wilderness. Their antlers, a symbol of strength and renewal, add to their allure, making them a cherished sight for nature enthusiasts and hunters alike. Yet, despite their beauty, deer are elusive creatures, preferring the peace and seclusion of their woodland habitats."
