ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,68C5324942FC67034015F5A8E7E9A338,The Breeding Corral is a specialized crafting station where players can breed their pets. The Breeding Corral is essential for any aspiring beastmaster looking to expand and strengthen their collection of pets.
