ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,7677AFC1404E0CAD7A0E8C85450A223E,"The Hitching Post is an essential structure for any mount owner, providing a secure spot for tethering your loyal steed. This versatile post not only allows a convenient place to tether your mount but also offers a communal solution for other players to park their mounts on your claimed land. "
