ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Devotion/DataTables/DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks.uexp,,DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51067_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">'I have seen the hoar-frost glittering in the sun,' she answered. 'I have heard the wind whispering across the everlasting snows.'</> - The Frost-Giant's Daughter

It is said Ymir sends these sacred tools out into the world for champions to find. With such a hatchet, one can harvest the ice of winter itself and use such material to craft garments and weapons holy to the frost giant god."
