ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Devotion/DataTables/DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks.uexp,,DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51457_ShortDesc,An Ankh used in the ritual purification of the dead
