ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_Name,Highland Berries
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_ShortDesc,"Small, red berries"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_LongDesc,"Growing in the cold of the highlands, these berries are used in the making of juice and wine. They can be eaten, though they do not offer much nourishment. Still, any sustenance is good sustenance when waiting for meatier prey."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_FirstModifier,Low Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_SecondModifier,Consumable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18005_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_Name,Desert Berries
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_ShortDesc,"Small, blue berries"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_LongDesc,"Growing in the dry wastes of the desert, these berries are used in the making of juice and wine. They can be eaten, though they do not offer much nourishment. Still, any sustenance is precious out in the desolate lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_FirstModifier,Low Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_SecondModifier,Consumable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_ThirdModifier,Ingredient
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18520_Name,Crude Planter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18520_ShortDesc,A crude planter for slowly growing plants
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18520_LongDesc,"When man discovered the secrets of agriculture, the world changed. No longer roving bands of battling tribes, the first villages and cities formed around the idea that going out hunting food was a lot harder than just growing it safely behind walls.

This planter is very crude, and seeds sown in it will grow slowly."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18521_Name,Planter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18521_ShortDesc,A planter for growing plants
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18521_LongDesc,"When man discovered the secrets of agriculture, the world changed. No longer roving bands of battling tribes, the first villages and cities formed around the idea that going out hunting food was a lot harder than just growing it safely behind walls.

This planter is a standard design, and seeds sown in it will grow at a regular rate."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18522_Name,Improved Planter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18522_ShortDesc,An improved planter for quickly growing plants
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18522_LongDesc,"When man discovered the secrets of agriculture, the world changed. No longer roving bands of battling tribes, the first villages and cities formed around the idea that going out hunting food was a lot harder than just growing it safely behind walls.

Sowing seeds in this planter will cause them to grow quickly over time."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18519_Name,Compost Heap
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18519_ShortDesc,A smelly pile of rotting matter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Horti/DataTables/DT_Horti_MergeItems.uexp,,ItemTable_18519_LongDesc,Ask not a man what goes into his compost heap. That is his business alone. It is what a man removes from his compost heap that matters.
