ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210101_ShortDesc,A sturdy bookshelf for housing books and other sundries
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210101_LongDesc,"Though not especially common in the Exiled Lands, those holdfasts which have managed to beat back the relentless tide of marauders and beasts do manage a semblance of civilization beyond basic survival. Though rare, reading and even limited study can develop in such places."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210102_Name,"Bookshelf, Tall"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210102_ShortDesc,A sturdy bookshelf for housing books and other sundries
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210102_LongDesc,"Though not especially common in the Exiled Lands, those holdfasts which have managed to beat back the relentless tide of marauders and beasts do manage a semblance of civilization beyond basic survival. Though rare, reading and even limited study can develop in such places."
