ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210105_LongDesc,A set of journals
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210106_Name,"Journal Row, Half"
