ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210108_Name,"Journal, Standing"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210108_ShortDesc,a set of written sheets of skin or paper or tablets of wood or ivory
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210108_LongDesc,"a set of written, printed, or blank sheets bound together between a front and back cover"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210114_Name,Simple Desk
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210114_ShortDesc,"A simple desk for working or learning, with room to store a small number of items"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210114_LongDesc,"In the Exiled Lands, among those who have managed to defend what they've built for long enough, civilization proceeds much as it does anywhere else: agriculture and game-keeping leads to wealth, and wealth leads to be recorded. Paper records become a necessity, and with them, a desk upon which to work."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210115_Name,Iron Torch
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210115_ShortDesc,A torch that can burn for an exceptionally long time
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210115_FirstModifier,Utility
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210116_Name,Tall Stool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210116_ShortDesc,A high round wooden stool
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210116_LongDesc,Useful for sitting and hurling at enemies.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210127_Name,Wooden Bathtub
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210127_ShortDesc,A rough-hewn tub fashioned from sturdy timber
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210127_LongDesc,"This crude wooden tub is a simple yet practical addition to any home in the Exiled Lands. While it may lack the elegance of finer designs, it provides a place to wash away dirt and grime after a long day of adventuring. Though humble, this tub offers a sense of comfort and routine in the midst of chaos, reminding you of the small pleasures in life."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210128_Name,Stygian Nobel Bath
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210128_ShortDesc,A tub for a nobel crafted from exquisite marble in the Stygian fashion.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210128_LongDesc,"This magnificent bath tub, is a testament to luxury and refinement. The smooth, cool surface gleams in the light, its intricate patterns telling tales of ancient craftsmanship and the mystique of the Stygian lands. Designed for those who seek indulgence, this spacious tub invites you to immerse yourself in warmth and serenity, washing away the rigors of your adventures. Marble baths are been favored by the elite, symbolizing both opulence and relaxation. As you recline in its depths, allow the soothing waters to transport you to a realm of tranquility, far removed from the harsh realities of the Exiled Lands."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210129_Name,Aquilonian Royal Bath
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210129_ShortDesc,A tub fit for Aquilonian Kings
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210129_LongDesc,"This exquisite bath tub, crafted from a stunning blend of black and white marble, epitomizes the elegance of Aquilonian craftsmanship. Its polished surfaces reflect light in a mesmerizing dance, showcasing intricate designs that pay homage to the rich history of the Aquilonian nobility. This opulent bath serves as a gathering place for the elite, offering a luxurious retreat where politics and leisure intertwine. As you immerse yourself in the warm waters, allow the soothing embrace of marble to wash away the burdens of leadership and adventure, inviting tranquility and camaraderie among those in you"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210130_Name,Herbalist Notes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210130_ShortDesc,Hand scrawled note about local herbs
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210130_LongDesc,"Herbs have a variety of uses including culinary, medicinal, and in some cases, spiritual. General usage of the term ""herb"" differs between culinary herbs and medicinal herbs; in medicinal or spiritual use, any parts of the plant might be considered as ""herbs"", including leaves, roots, flowers, seeds, root bark, inner bark (and cambium), resin and pericarp."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210131_Name,Herbalist Notes
