ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210217_Name,Tavern Bar
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210217_ShortDesc,"A Bar with a counter for serving guests, and cabinets for storage"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,Core_ItemTable_210217_LongDesc,"The counter at which drinks are served by a bartender is called ""the bar"". This term is applied, as a synecdoche, to drinking establishments called ""bars"". This counter typically stores a variety of beers, wines, liquors, and non-alcoholic ingredients, and is organized to facilitate the bartender's work."
