ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102154_ShortDesc,"A garden is a planned space, usually outdoors, set aside for the display, cultivation and enjoyment of plants and other forms of nature."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102154_LongDesc,"Some gardens are for ornamental purposes only, while some gardens also produce food crops, sometimes in separate areas, or sometimes intermixed with the ornamental plants. Food-producing gardens are distinguished from farms by their smaller scale, more labor-intensive methods, and their purpose (enjoyment of a hobby rather than produce for sale). Flower gardens combine plants of different heights, colors, textures, and fragrances to create interest and delight the senses."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Emberlight/Shared/DataTables/DT_Ember_Items.uexp,,dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102155_ShortDesc,"A garden is a planned space, usually outdoors, set aside for the display, cultivation and enjoyment of plants and other forms of nature."
