ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120518_Name,Masterpiece Armor Repair Kit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120518_ShortDesc,A patch kit for repairing damaged armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120518_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Conan's dark scarred face was darker yet with passion; his black armor was hacked to tatters and splashed with blood; his great sword red to the cross-piece.</> - The Scarlet Citadel

A warrior needs to be able to rely on their armor in the heat of battle. When the broadswords swing, a layer of leather or steel can mean the difference between life and death.

This patch kit, containing scraps of metals, leather and hide, can be used to repair the most egregious insults to a piece of armor, though it will never be able to repair them completely."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120518_FirstModifier,Armor Repair
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120519_Name,Masterpiece Weapon Repair Kit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120519_ShortDesc,A toolkit for repairing damaged weapons
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120519_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">He rushed in, hacking madly, but Conan, recognizing him, shattered his sword with a short terrific chop and with a powerful push of his open hand sent him reeling to the floor.</> - The Phoenix on the Sword

When the fury of battle has subsided and the lightning clash of weapons has stilled, the victors are left to count the cost. And sometimes the price of battle is the very weapons that are used to wage it.

This kit, containing a whetstone, a hone and a small portion of blade oil, will allow even unskilled crafters to repair the worst damage to their blades, though it will never be able to renew them completely."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120519_FirstModifier,Weapon Repair
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120544_Name,Perfected Weapon Repair Kit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120544_ShortDesc,A toolkit for repairing damaged weapons
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120544_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">He rushed in, hacking madly, but Conan, recognizing him, shattered his sword with a short terrific chop and with a powerful push of his open hand sent him reeling to the floor.</> - The Phoenix on the Sword

When the fury of battle has subsided and the lightning clash of weapons has stilled, the victors are left to count the cost. And sometimes the price of battle is the very weapons that are used to wage it.

This kit, containing a whetstone, a hone and a small portion of blade oil, will allow even unskilled crafters to repair the worst damage to their blades, though it will never be able to renew them completely."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120544_FirstModifier,Weapon Repair
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120545_Name,Masterpiece Weapon Kit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120545_ShortDesc,A bag of unpleasant things that can be attached to weapons to increase their damage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120545_LongDesc,"Some warriors adorn their weapons to intimidate their foes and make them a memorable presence on the battlefield.

But the collection of spikes and studs contained in this bag have a single purpose - to wreck foes. Whether hammer, sword, or spear - there is something here to bring ruination, laceration, and devastation to the bodies and minds of enemies everywhere.

Applying this advanced kit to a weapon will increase its damage considerably."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/TDI_LegendaryRepair/DataTables/TDI_LegKitItemTable.uexp,,TDI_LegKitItemTable_22120545_FirstModifier,Weapon Modification
