ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_Name,Preservation Box
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_ShortDesc,A cold box for preserving
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18507_LongDesc,"Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_Name,Improved Preservation Box
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_ShortDesc,A cold box for preserving
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18508_LongDesc,"Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay. This larger icebox holds more food and preserves it longer."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_Name,Dyer's Bench
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_ShortDesc,A dyer's bench for 'vat dyeing'. 
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_18543_LongDesc,"<LoreItalics>The man in the boat was a picturesque figure. A crimson scarf was knotted about his head; his wide silk breeches, of flaming hue, were upheld by a broad sash, which likewise supported a scimitar in a shagreen scabbard.</> - The Devil in Iron

Through the careful application of berries, bark, and beetle-guts, the artisanal dyer can transform natural fabrics and hides into an amazing array of hues and colors. Originated in Vendhya, vat dyes were so named because of the high capacity containers employed in the ancient artform."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_Name,Medium Crate
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80208_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_Name,Small Crate
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80209_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_Name,Large Crate
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_ShortDesc,A wooden crate for storage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80212_LongDesc,"A box made out of wood, as found in many a market. Crates allow large quantities of storage but being made solely out of wood, are much weaker than their strongbox and chest counterparts."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_Name,Cupboard
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_ShortDesc,A shelved piece of furniture
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80743_LongDesc,"Often made of wood and featuring shelves and doors, cupboards are places to stow dishware or even display certain ornaments or property."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_Name,Reinforced Wooden Box
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_ShortDesc,A large wooden box for storing items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80850_LongDesc,"A receptacle to store excess items and materials, this box is made from simple materials. It can be locked against strangers, but a determined thief will be able to smash it open and take what they please."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_Name,Wooden Box
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_ShortDesc,A wooden box for storing items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80851_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this box is made from simple materials. It can be locked against strangers, but a determined thief will be able to smash it open and take what they please."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_Name,Large Chest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_ShortDesc,A large chest for storing items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80852_LongDesc,"Somewhere to place excess items and materials, this chest is made from sturdy materials. It can be locked against strangers, and all but the most determined thief will be deterred. No system is perfect, however."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_Name,Vault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_ShortDesc,A vault for storing valuable items
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/double_storage_space/DT_DoubledStorage.uexp,,ItemTable_80853_LongDesc,"This vault, made from steel and iron, represents the most secure location to store excess items and materials. Breaking into this vault will require a heroic effort."
