ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Beyond_Decor_II/Data/BDII_ItemTable.uexp,,BDII_ItemTable_505071570_Name,(BR) Jinxed Book Pile 01-A
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Beyond_Decor_II/Data/BDII_ItemTable.uexp,,BDII_ItemTable_505071570_ShortDesc,Precariously perched piles of books
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/Beyond_Decor_II/Data/BDII_ItemTable.uexp,,BDII_ItemTable_505071570_LongDesc,"These jinxed book piles are just perfect to showcase how knowledgeable you are, they also work quite well as a makeshift ladder, and they do wonders at keeping pesky bosses away from your lab, for fear of catastrophic book collapse. On second thought, perhaps a skilled scientist could use such precarious book piles as a way to incapacitate and immobilize said dancer bosses for collection of biological samples. Either way, stack with care! What book were you looking for again...?"
