ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490391_Name,Big Brown Bear Pet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490391_ShortDesc,A tame cuddly bear that will fight for you
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490391_LongDesc,The wealth of Hyborian nations is built upon the backs of their beasts of burden and those who know how to handle an animal. And the mark of a man can be weighed by the manner in which he treats the least of his animals. Feed them and give them a place to live and they can be the greatest allies in the world. Neglect them and reap the consequences.
