ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490141_ShortDesc,"A poison that causes Heavy Bleed, a non-stacking high damage bleed that can be applied to weapons"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490141_LongDesc,"A poison that counts as a bleed rather than a poison, making it uncleansable by standard methods. Deals 0-4 damage twice a second, lasts for 7 seconds. Always deals maximum damage to targets under half health. Does not stack."
