ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490642_ShortDesc,"A yellow drink that tastes somewhat bitter, but is very refreshing"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490642_LongDesc,"At one point in the history of man, lemons became such a vital resource that harlots would often make efforts to empty entire farmsteads of them overnight. These 'Lemon Stealing Whores,' as they were so named, were quickly hunted down and hanged for their crimes. Those that remained ended up disbanding rather than face the noose, and all that remains of them now are tales of their misdeeds."
