ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490782_Name,Offhand Light Grenades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490782_ShortDesc,A small light orb that explodes on impact with a temporary light
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2490782_LongDesc,"Glowing Goop is a naturally occuring light within the Exiled Lands and regions beyond, and up until now nobody had the brilliant idea to put a bunch of it in a glass bottle to create an on-the-go light source. Look at you, you little pioneer!"
