ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491638_LongDesc,A Redtail Radish straight from the Redtail Radish Farms made by an annoying rabbit named Liaru. They're said to be unusually sweet and quite spicy... Commissioned by Liaru
