ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491652_Name,Dragon's Daughter Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491652_ShortDesc,An ancient vampiric sword forged by Rosália when she charged against a dragon’s breath.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491652_LongDesc,"“As the ancient dragon advanced on her sister, so too did the vampire Rosália. Her war cry pierced the red dragon’s ears and forced him into battle. He coiled and withered and with one savage breath he threw a torrent of flame at her, but today was not the day she would die, no, today Rosália would defy the depths of hell and charge through the dragon’s fire. In one frenzied blow, the Great Dohrgar was defeated, and with it the forging of a new blade.”After a perilous battle with the ancient known as Dohrgar, the old black steel blade was forged again, reborn from the dragon’s breath as an unbreakable diamond. The Daughter carries many tales of violence and blood, it’s very presence mustering fear in the heart, and freezing dread. With the sinister addition of small funnels along it’s sides, The Daughter drinks it’s victims, nurturing its wielder. It is said, through the webbed echoes of time, that it’s wielder, Rosália, had bestowed the blade upon the most prestigious of warriors, those that could feed the sword’s hunger for blood. Created by Corintio."
