ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491658_LongDesc,"While most forged and crafted armor exists in an effort to dampen or even stop blows, light armor prides itself on doing neither - instead, it allows the wearer to dodge and weave with unhindered agility to avoid strikes entirely."
