ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491690_Name,Northern Warden Helm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491690_ShortDesc,A noble cover that restores the user when landing Finisher Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491690_LongDesc,"Originally designed in a time of turmoil, and presented to a royal gamewarden in the event things soured for the kingdom. The helm served both to protect and remind of the land they served."
