ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_Name,Scholar Icestaff
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_ShortDesc,A staff that lets its wielder channel ice-based magic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_LongDesc,"In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations. Commission item."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_SecondModifier,Ranged Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491694_ThirdModifier,Frost
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491695_Name,xx_Orb_IceStaff_Light
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_Name,Scutum Shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_ShortDesc,"A large bulwark, cleansing yourself and allies around you when blocking"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_LongDesc,"The scutum was light enough to be held in one hand and its large height and width covered the entire wielder, making him very unlikely to be hit by missile fire and in hand-to-hand combat.The shape of the scutum allowed packed formations of legionaries to overlap their shields to provide an effective barrier against projectiles.""Scaeva, with one eye gone, his thigh and shoulder wounded, and his shield bored through [with arrows] in a hundred and twenty places, continued to guard the gate of a fortress put in his charge. Acilius in the sea-fight at Massilia grasped the stern of one of the enemy’s ships, and when his right hand was lopped off, rivaling the famous exploit of the Greek hero Cynegirus, boarded the ship and drove the enemy before him with the boss of his shield."" - Roman writer Suetonius recorded anecdotes of centurion Cassius Scaeva and legionary Gaius Acilius who fought  Battle of Dyrrachium and the battle of Massilia, respectively."" Commissioned by JimothyJamothy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_SecondModifier,Curative Shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491696_ThirdModifier,Stamina Cost (+25%)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_Name,(HA) Liara's Fists
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_ShortDesc,Focus your energy and unleash the wrath of the Y'sagi.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_LongDesc,Commission item.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_FirstModifier,Developer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_ThirdModifier,Slowness
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491697_FourthModifier,Knockback
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491698_Name,Longsword of the Forge Snake
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491698_ShortDesc,"A Blade forged by the Master Reshaper, Daiyu, empowered with fire"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491698_LongDesc,"In a place deep within the Is-Not, there is a place called the Mallery, where the Sun was shattered and born anew. In the burning heart of the Mallery this blade was spun into existence by the Forge Snake.  For seven and seven and seven days, the Serpent labored before bringing this blade to fruition. For some, a Magnum Opus, For the Serpent, another step on the long road to ascension. Inflicts Forgeflame, reducing armor and dealing damage for a brief time, and has a chance to increase outgoing damage when dealing damage. Commissioned by Daiyu"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491698_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491698_SecondModifier,Weapon
