ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_Name,Eluskan Knife
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_ShortDesc,"A small, fast one-handed blade imbued with Slowness & Empowering Assault"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_LongDesc,"Often used for digging, and other means of building. In the hands of a pioneer though it has been found it can be used as an effective close combat weapon. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_ThirdModifier,Slowness
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491733_FourthModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_Name,Stormforged Eastblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_ShortDesc,Two handed relic katana imbued with Charged Finishers & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_LongDesc,"Tempered in the stormforge, a place eternally trapped in the heart of a raging tempest. This blade thrums with unrelenting power; energizing the wielder, and discharging its unstable kinetics to those unfortunate enough to meet its edge. Commission item."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_SecondModifier,Weapon
