ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491734_FourthModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_Name,Cindershot Gunblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_ShortDesc,"A longsword, with an attached scattergun underneath"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_LongDesc,Commission item.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_SecondModifier,Projectile Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_ThirdModifier,Hellfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491735_FourthModifier,Can't Be Transmogged
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_Name,Martyr's Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_ShortDesc,A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Hellfire & Empowering Health
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_LongDesc,"The Spear of the Martyr is a legendary warspear, modeled after the weapon of Esmein's revered hero. Crafted from rare, golden-hued metal, the spear's shaft is both strong and flexible, adorned with intricate engravings depicting the Martyr's sacrifice and Esmein's founding. The double-edged leaf-shaped spearhead is razor-sharp and perfectly balanced, etched with ancient runes for divine strength. An ornate golden guard at the base, shaped like outstretched wings, symbolizes the Martyr's protection. Beyond its function as a weapon, the Spear of the Martyr is a relic of profound spiritual significance, carried by Esmein's highest-ranking warrior-priests in battle, ceremonies, and festivals. To wield it is to bear the weight of the nation's ideals and the legacy of its hero. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_ThirdModifier,Empowering Health
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491736_FourthModifier,Hellfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_Name,Dawning Light Halberd
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_ShortDesc,A two-handed halberd imbued with Empowering Assault and Withering
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_LongDesc,"Forged in the sacred fires of the Holy See's ancient forges, the Halberd of the Dawning Light is a masterwork weapon imbued with divine power. Crafted from the finest mythril mined from the northern mountains, its gleaming blade and spike reflect the radiant light of Aeloria, the goddess of celestial bodies. The shaft, made from the heartwood of the ancient oaks of Assam’s Groves, is Coated in Mythril and then engraved with intricate runes and symbols of the Luminary Order, each one a prayer for strength, wisdom, and protection. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_FourthModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491737_FifthModifier,Withering Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_Name,Bloodfang Ultra Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_ShortDesc,A massive two handed sword imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_LongDesc,"The Bloodfang is an awe-inspiring ultra greatsword, both a fearsome weapon and a revered symbol of Dagtherian prowess. Above the hilt, a masterfully sculpted metal wolf head glares menacingly, its eyes set with glinting rubies that seem to burn with a malevolent light. The wolf's maw is open wide in a snarl. Emerging from the wolf's maw is the blade itself, a massive, single-edged slab of enchanted steel. The blade is broad and slightly curved, tapering to a wickedly sharp point it has been tempered in the blood of the monsters it is destined to slay. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_FourthModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491738_FifthModifier,Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491739_Name,Rimebreaker Battleaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491739_ShortDesc,A two-handed axe imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491739_LongDesc,"The greataxe stands tall and formidable. Its sturdy, dark wooden shaft features intricate carvings of ancient runes and intertwining vines, inspired by the northern wildlands' rich culture. The shaft is capped with a polished, silvery metal guard, engraved with delicate filigree depicting mythical battles and legendary heroes from northmen lore. The most striking feature is its bardiche-style axe head. The broad, slightly curved blade, is forged from a dark metal that absorbs light. Its razor-sharp edge cleaves through armor and flesh with ease, while jagged spikes on the back add a secondary function of piercing or hooking opponents. Exuding power and craftsmanship, the greataxe embodies the fierce spirit of the northmen, making it a relic of the northern wildlands. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491739_FirstModifier,Relic
