ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_Name,Archeron's Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Hellfire & Healing Finishers"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_LongDesc,"A sleek blade with no discernable features. Old legends state that these blades were merely a mass-produced prototype for the Archeron's Rune Knights. The quality of the ""prototype"" speaks volumes in regards to the strength of the Archeron's armies. Commissioned by Kaidus."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_ThirdModifier,Hellfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491753_FourthModifier,Healing Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491754_Name,Veilkeeper's Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491754_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Lightning & Slowness"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491754_LongDesc,"A strange sword forged by the Veilkeepers of Aetheria. It is said these weapons are the symbol of the Veilkeepers, and were originally created with obscure metals that imbued it with the power of lightning. Not much more is known of these blades due to their scarcity. Commissioned by Kaidus."
