ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491755_ShortDesc,A two-handed lightweight blade that inflicts Cursed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491755_LongDesc,Elegant noblesword with a raven on the guard. Commissioned by Kaidus.
