ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491758_Name,Luminary Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491758_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, possessing Cleansing properties"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491758_LongDesc,Weapon carried by the Luminary Order's soldiers. It is most popular amongst their priests and mages that need to carry a blade into combat. Commissioned by Kaidus.
