ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491760_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Withering"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491760_LongDesc,"Silver blades are oft wielded against undead due to the effects it has on flesh, but make no mistake - they are just as much a danger to the living."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491760_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491760_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491760_ThirdModifier,Withering Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_Name,Wretched Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Energizing Assault & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_LongDesc,"There is an otherwordly stench of death and decay that wafts from the blade, and no matter how much one might try and clean or shine it, the ruinous weapon retains its battered and broken form. No doubt a myriad of souls have been claimed by this weapon, and while wielding it, you get the sense you can add many more to that number."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_ThirdModifier,Decaying Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491761_FourthModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491762_Name,Castle Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491762_ShortDesc,A two-handed lightweight blade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491762_LongDesc,"A elegant blade wielded by the noble class in more civilized environments. The weight of the weapon lends itself to be an exceptionally controllable tool, so much so that one might confuse dueling for art rather than relentless violence."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491762_FirstModifier,Epic
