ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491770_Name,Little Liaru Rabbit Pet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491770_ShortDesc,A dressed up rabbit that will cuddle with you
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491770_LongDesc,The wealth of Hyborian nations is built upon the backs of their beasts of burden and those who know how to handle an animal. And the mark of a man can be weighed by the manner in which he treats the least of his animals. Feed them and give them a place to live and they can be the greatest allies in the world. Neglect them and reap the consequences.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491770_FirstModifier,Pet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491771_Name,Bundled Explosive Jars
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491771_ShortDesc,"Many reinforced ceramic vases, loaded with explosive powder"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491771_LongDesc,"Explosives have become a staple in the destruction of man's grand architecture - and these jars have proven time and time again a key component in transporting the volatile powder contained within. Deals significantly more damage than a regular Explosive Jar, but has a shorter placement range and can only be detonated by interacting with the fuse or another explosion."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491772_Name,Salvation Lifestaff
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491772_ShortDesc,A staff that lets its wielder channel healing & buffing magics
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491772_LongDesc,"In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations. Commissioned by Salvari."
