ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_Name,Lume Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_ShortDesc,A one handed slashing blade imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_LongDesc,"Crafted from a piece of ""Nightsky"", this blade was once wielded by a long-lost planar travelling civilisation. They used weapons like these in their fight against Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. The material is rumoured to both cut and protect from the Madness caused by said Horrors. One of those famed weapons has found itself in the possession of the Archivist of Elsewhere. Up until this day, the blade's material reminds everyone, that it once was possible to temper the nights starry sky into a solid material. Commissioned by Baldur."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_ThirdModifier,Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491780_FourthModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491781_Name,Cyron Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491781_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Withering & Empowering Assault"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491781_LongDesc,"Another blade supposedly created by or in homage to a Long Lost Civilization. Made from an alien crystal-like material, it is rumoured to inflict wounds onto Ghosts, Spirits and other ethereal creatures. Aside from that, it cuts flesh just as good. Commissioned by Baldur."
