ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491789_LongDesc,xx_longdesc
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_Name,Pilum Shortspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Golden Finishers & Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_LongDesc,"""Legionaries of the late Republic and early Empire often carried two pila, with one sometimes being lighter than the other. Standard tactics called for Roman soldiers to throw one of them (both if time permitted) at the enemy, just before charging to engage with the gladius."" Commissioned by JimothyJamothy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_ThirdModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491790_FourthModifier,Golden Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_Name,Pilum Javelin
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_ShortDesc,A one-handed spear that can be thrown multiple times
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_LongDesc,"""Legionaries of the late Republic and early Empire often carried two pila, with one sometimes being lighter than the other. Standard tactics called for Roman soldiers to throw one of them (both if time permitted) at the enemy, just before charging to engage with the gladius."" Commissioned by JimothyJamothy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_FirstModifier,Epic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_SecondModifier,Throwing
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_ThirdModifier,Returning
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491791_FourthModifier,Cripple
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_Name,Glacier's Fang Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_ShortDesc,A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Frostburn & Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_LongDesc,This spear is favored by many warriors whom live in the biting cold of the north. The blade feels cold to the touch as if it were made from ice. Commissioned by SkyTheGuy.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_ThirdModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491792_FourthModifier,Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_Name,Ithurazal Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_LongDesc,"The sword, forged by the legendary blacksmith Ithuriel in honor of his beloved wife Astara, is a masterpiece of unparalleled beauty and power. The blade, etched with intricate inscriptions that shimmer with a mystical light, speaks of eternal love and unwavering strength. A single, radiant blue gem set into the hilt glows with an inner fire, bestowing the sword with extraordinary abilities. This weapon is not only a deadly tool but also a work of art, embodying the skill, passion, and devotion of its creator. It is truly unique, a symbol of Ithuriel's love and craftsmanship, destined to be unmatched in all realms. Commissioned by Aregamir."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491793_ThirdModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_Name,Malice Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Cursed Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_LongDesc,"This legendary sword carries an ancient legend, once wielded by The Herald of Darkness who spread terror among all enemies of his beloved Malak under the blood moon's light. Together, they bent the will of fate, their names etched into history as The Bloody Nightmares. Forged by the shadows, this powerful weapon is a grim reminder of their dark deeds, a heirloom of fear and domination. Commissioned by Nashi."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_FirstModifier,Legendary
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491794_ThirdModifier,Cursed Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_Name,Twinned Serpant's Head Blades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_ShortDesc,"Paired khopeshes, imbued with Empowering Assault & Withering"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_LongDesc,"Serpent's Fang and Scorpion's Sting, are forged in dark metal, their curved blades adorned only with ancient runes along the fuller. These runes pulse with a faint crimson light, hinting at the chaotic power within. The simple, unadorned hilts provide a firm grip, allowing the weapons to strike swiftly and lethally, embodying the destructive will of Set. Commissioned by Koriadris, Chosen of Set."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_ThirdModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491795_FourthModifier,Withering Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491796_Name,Justice's Edge Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491796_ShortDesc,"A one handed slashing blade, imbued with Empowering Assault & Withering"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491796_LongDesc,"A radiant weapon blessed by Tyr, the god of justice. The blade gleams with a divine light, its surface etched with intricate runes that glow faintly with a silvery-blue hue. The hilt is wrapped in fine, dark leather, adorned with a small, polished emblem of Tyr's scales of justice. When wielded, the sword resonates with a soft, harmonious hum, and its strikes are imbued with the power to vanquish evil and uphold righteousness. Justice's Edge is said to guide its bearer’s hand, ensuring every blow is true and just. Commissioned by Corethan, Paladin of Tyr."
