ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491821_ShortDesc,A two-handed maul imbued with Slowness & Charged Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491821_LongDesc,"""This hammer, featuring a twisted purple handle and golden adornments, is blessed by the priests of the Luminary High Order to grant extra strength in the pursuit of justice. Thanks to this blessing, the hammer's impact strikes with the force of thunder, followed by the kiss of lightning. Each hammer is custom-etched with unique designs that commemorate the individual efforts of its wielder in the ways of Aeloria and is forged by Master Blacksmiths from the Holy See."" Commissioned by Sentique."
