ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491822_Name,Nightsky Halberd
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491822_ShortDesc,A two-handed halberd imbued with Energizing Assault & Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491822_LongDesc,"A long axe-like Halberd made from Nightsky - a mysterious material said to both protect against and hurt Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. Who or what used Nightsky to brandish such a weapon, is unknown.Up until this day, the blade's material reminds everyone, that it once was possible to temper the nights starry sky into a solid material. Commissioned by Baldraz."
