ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_Name,Noblesword of the Umbralyn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, infused with Lightning & Healing Finishers"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_LongDesc,"A blade that was forged in Shadow-Fire, born of The Umbralyn's Void. This blade could only be made if one was capable of melding the dark so no light could brighten. To hold such a blade is to know what the Dark Divine feels like; calm, controlled, like Order itself. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_ThirdModifier,Lightning Infused
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491845_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_Name,Noblesword of the Acolytes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Healing Attacks & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_LongDesc,"A blade forged only for those who have braved The Umbralyn, and embraced what Fate guided them for. Runes are scribed within it, partnered only by the deepest hued blacks that litter the blade, yet an almost Divine feeling rests within it. This blade is normally only forged for an Acolyte who has reached a deeper bond with Erebos by dedicating their soul to him, but once such a blade is forged it cares not for who wields it, only that Order is brought by it's edge. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_ThirdModifier,Decaying Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491846_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_Name,Kuro's Eastblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_ShortDesc,A two-handed katana imbued with Lightning & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_LongDesc,"Stories of Osmiran legends tell of a Wolf Yokai that once ruled over a dark shrine deep within the mountains. It's told he would guide those who lost their way, heeling them away from his shrine. Those who braved The Dark Pit, however, would find themselves in the Umbralyn below Osmira with a Kami's shrine in the void of darkness above a lake. Some stories say those who could please a Kitsune's delights were offered a gift, a blade made in the Osmiran ways, bound with the very shadow of the one who holds the blade. Some say the blade is a curse, that they hear a voice that comes from the blade itself. Asking for battle, demanding to bring order, and to guide the lost. Some even say the blade guides the user to Kitsune Spirit Orbs, to bring them back to other younger Kitsune who lose their way in the dark, but it's only a legend.. right? Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_ThirdModifier,Lightning Infused
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491847_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_Name,Eclipsed Sin Ultra Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_ShortDesc,A massive two handed sword imbued with Lightning & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_LongDesc,"Long ago, to earn ones freedom, a blade was once made. Forged by an old Dark-Elf smith at the request of the Northern Tzar, this blade was held by a gladiator who used it to earn his freedom to serve as a Knight for the very Tzar who asked for the blade. Stained in blood, it's as if someone has forged Light itself into a cage, leaving small crystal gaps to let it hone the blades very own edge with a strange Divine Energy. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491848_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
