ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491849_Name,Humanity's Fists
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491849_ShortDesc,"Paired fist weapons, imbued with Charged Finishers & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491849_LongDesc,"Those who have trained in the arts of hand-to-hand combat sometimes say they have reached a flow like state. Where in the world itself slows down, and they feel light as a feather itself. If you train to stay in this state of mind, you may even hit a spark of energy, almost as if it's the very core of what it means to be mortal. Even your wounds will feel lighter, almost as if you've been healed. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
