ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491861_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Frostburn & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491861_LongDesc,"A profane harpoon, wielded by the one who has made contact with the River Styx. It is forged of metal not made to be forged, and made with the bones of a great beast. It is said to bear the memories of those it's wielder has killed. Commissioned by Lilitofthelake."
