ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491866_Name,Black Centurion Helm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491866_ShortDesc,A piece of armor made to protect
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491866_LongDesc,Belonged to a leader in a vast army. They charged into battle and were swallowed up by the enemy. Abandoned and left to die. Do not put all your trust into men whose hearts are selfish. Commissioned by JimothyJamothy.
