ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_Name,Black Centurion Shortblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_ShortDesc,A one-handed shortsword imbued with Invigorating Kills & Cursed Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_LongDesc,"A shortsword of myth from a bygone age. Welding it, you are overcome with a strong urge to enact vengeance against any who have wronged you. Commissioned by JimothyJamothy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_ThirdModifier,Cursed Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491868_FourthModifier,Invigorating Kills
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_Name,Black Centurion Shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_ShortDesc,A tattered shield that accumilates power as attacks are landed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_LongDesc,"This shield once belonged to a hero of myth, from a bygone age. Weathered, worn, and broken from centuries of neglect. It may still be of use, or just a cool relic. Commissioned by JimothyJamothy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_SecondModifier,Tempest
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491869_ThirdModifier,Stamina Cost (+25%)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_Name,Hoardkeeper's Fang Infernal Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_ShortDesc,A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Empowering Assault & Infernal Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_LongDesc,"Hoardkeeper's Fang is a war spear of impressive length, standing at nearly seven feet tall. The spear's shaft is forged from a rare alloy, giving it a deep, dark bronze color with veins of gold running through it, shimmering like molten metal. The texture of the shaft is rough yet finely wrought, designed to resemble the scales of a dragon, providing a firm grip for its wielder. Etched along its length are intricate runes in the ancient tongue of the dragonborn, telling the tale of Fafranax's ascension to godhood and the creation of the dragonborn race. The spearhead itself is a masterful piece of craftsmanship. The blade glows faintly with a golden hue, as if it holds the light of a thousand treasures within. It takes the shape of a dragon's fang, long and curved, with serrated edges that glint in the light. The tip is razor-sharp, capable of piercing the toughest of armors. Along the base of the spearhead, a pair of dragon wings made of the same glowing metal curl backward, serving both as guards and as a testament to the weapon's divine origin. Commissioned by kalicojack."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_ThirdModifier,Infernal Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491870_FourthModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_Name,Twinned Eluskan Officer's Blades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_ShortDesc,"Paired blades, imbued with Healing Finishers & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_LongDesc,"Forged in the heart of the empire’s greatest city, these twin blades reflect the Eluskan ambition to reach beyond the mundane. Each blade, crafted from the rare and resilient Luxite steel, emits a faint, ethereal glow powered by Lux fuel, symbolizing the eternal flame of innovation that drives the Eluskan people. The hilts, adorned with the insignia of the Callidus line—two interlocking gears—serve as a constant reminder of the empire's mechanical mastery and its legacy of technological prowess. Engraved with the phrase ""Beyond Mortality, We Ascend,"" the Stellar Blades of the Callidus are more than mere weapons; they are a declaration of the Eluskan Empire's destiny. In the hands of an officer, these blades become an extension of their will, cutting a path through darkness and doubt, leading their people toward a future among the stars. Commissioned by Mythic RP & Parry."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_ThirdModifier,Healing Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491871_FourthModifier,Decaying Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491872_Name,Bloodthirst Knife
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491872_ShortDesc,"A small, fast one-handed blade imbued with Vile Finishers & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491872_LongDesc,"What some find repulsive and terrible, others still may find as alluring as the sweetest fruit. Murder and bloodshed serves as no exception to this rule. Commissioned by Agony."
