ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491907_Name,Wizard's Staff Divine Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491907_ShortDesc,"A two handed godly warspear, imbued with Energizing Assault & Frostburn"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491907_LongDesc,"A long staff befit for a whimsical Wizard, made from Nightsky - said to both protect against and hurt Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. Who or what used these materials is only known to a few. This weapon may have been forged by the Forge Snake for a certain whimsical Wizard with a fondness for cheese. Commissioned by Baldraz."
