ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491913_ShortDesc,A massive two handed relic sword imbued with violent spirits
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491913_LongDesc,"When using your offhand attack, instead of a strong overhead, you will perform an overhead that unleashes a powerful AoE effect infront of you that deals damage. Deals increased damage if landing both the weapon strike and the AoE effect. Gain +300 armor for 5 seconds when dealing damage."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491913_FirstModifier,Relic
