ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491921_LongDesc,"Animals have long used their claws to defend their homes, hunt, climb, fight, and survive. You've gone and taken their claws to do just the same."
