ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491961_LongDesc,"This large knife was found next to an old barrel oozing blood and rotted flesh. The weapon sat for a long time, untouched, and marred by both rust and use. Commissioned by SmurfCat1."
