ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_Name,Soulshard Shortspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Healing Attacks & Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_LongDesc,It's said that this spear was forged using the remains of a destroyed lich's obelisk. Commissioned by Wolfy.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_ThirdModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491990_FourthModifier,Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_Name,Scythe of the Hallow
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_ShortDesc,A two-handed reaper imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_LongDesc,"A vile, unholy blade infused with dark magic and stuck crudely atop a shaft of rotted wood, this weapon was made to be wielded only by those who would embrace its darkness. Even simply holding it may cause one to hear whispers, see that which is not truly there. To use it is to give oneself its power, the power to siphon life from those it strikes, to rot the marrow in their bones and plague the flesh beneath their skin. More than a weapon this twisted abomination of a tool is an omen, a promise that the end is near, the only question is for who. Shall you bring ruin to your foes, rot to the living and death to any who dare challenge your might? Or shall you fall completely to the blade, and be nothing more than another foolish soul to sate its endless hunger? Time will tell. Commissioned by Harbinger72."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_ThirdModifier,Healing Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_FourthModifier,Decaying Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491991_FifthModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_Name,Decaying Stitcher Noblesword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_ShortDesc,"A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Healing Attacks & Withering Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_LongDesc,"Considering its design, this unusual blade handles well in the right hands. Blood seems to seep into the blade on contact, while wounds inflicted by it sear its victims with a debilitating decay and rot, limiting their movement while eating away at their flesh. Commissioned by Rennyyyy."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_ThirdModifier,Withering Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491992_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491993_Name,Waning Crescent Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491993_ShortDesc,A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Specter Bane & Invigorating Kills
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491993_LongDesc,A glaive forged from a silvery alloy that gleams like moonlight and appears anathema to the undead. Commission item.
