ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491994_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Soulfire & Corruption Removal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491994_LongDesc,A lightweight spear that drains corruption from its wielder and then sears foes with the same. Commission item.
