ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491996_Name,Cursed Guardian's Sword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491996_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Cursed Strikes & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491996_LongDesc,"""I didn't choose to wear the armour and carry the sword, nor was I asked. I was born and raised to be the last line of defense for someone whose life is more important than mine. If I fail in my task, death would be a merciful punishment."" Commissioned by ElftasticNicky."
