ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491996_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491997_Name,Green Seer's Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491997_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Brood Poison & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491997_LongDesc,"A hardened steel sword with an embossed bronze cross guard, its edge is laced with a draining poison that leaves its victim sapped of life with each strike. Commissioned by Ram."
