ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491997_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491998_Name,Green Seer's Knife
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491998_ShortDesc,"A small, fast one-handed blade imbued with Slowness & Lightning"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491998_LongDesc,A hardened steel knife with an embossed bronze cross guard used by alchemists and nature mages to prepare ingredients. Commissioned by Ram.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491998_FirstModifier,Relic
