ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491999_Name,Green Seer's Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491999_ShortDesc,"A two-handed sword, imbued with Brood Poison & Empowering Assault"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491999_LongDesc,"A hardened steel greatsword with an embossed bronze cross guard, an insidious poison leaves its victims open for critical strikes. Commissioned by Ram."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2491999_FirstModifier,Relic
