ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492000_ShortDesc,An exquisite robe from the distant lands of Khitai
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492000_FirstModifier,Medium
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492001_Name,Khitan Imperial Wizards Skirt
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492001_ShortDesc,An exquisite skirt from the distant lands of Khitai.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492001_FirstModifier,Medium
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492002_Name,Demonforged Scythe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492002_ShortDesc,"An unholy two-handed reaper, with a hunger for souls"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492002_LongDesc,"A heretical weapon forged in a cold flame and baptized by the life essence of a devil. Do not be fooled by its regal appearence; for it serves a singular, wretched purpose: The severance of soul from body."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492002_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492002_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492003_Name,Ascendant Core
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492003_ShortDesc,"A celestial material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492003_LongDesc,"What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a different kind of power; the fusion of both the natural world and life itself. Trapped forever in a battle of harmony and discord, the raw potential of this object is near unmatched."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_Name,Sinner's Knife
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_ShortDesc,"A one-handed haunted blade, enhancing its wielder's murders"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_LongDesc,"Thousands of years and just as many lives have crossed this blade, and yet, if a weapon could feel unsatisfied - this one would be."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_ThirdModifier,Bloodlust
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492004_FourthModifier,Bleed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_Name,Abyssal Eastblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_ShortDesc,"A two-handed katana, marked by the unending Abyss"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_LongDesc,"A historic blade, first wielded by one who gazed into the endless Abyss and found a fragment of its power. The unnatural edge passes through skin, bone, and metal as if they were no more than an inconvenice, but the glimpses and whispers of the void that the blade offers threaten to drive even the wisest mad."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492005_ThirdModifier,Voidtouched
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_Name,Fatebinder's Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_ShortDesc,"A one-handed longsword, forged in the flames of Chaos"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_LongDesc,"The threads of fate are carefully woven for all living beings when they are brought into this world. Each and every moment, all triumphs and misfortunes, are but chapters in a story. This blade serves as a way to change their endings."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492006_ThirdModifier,Blade of Fate
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492007_Name,Voidmetal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492007_ShortDesc,An ingot forged with forbidden techniques and dark magic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492007_LongDesc,"Neither heat nor hammers are capable of shaping this metal, for it does not obey the laws of this world. The only thing powerful enough to shape Voidmetal is an open mind, and from there, anything is possible..."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_Name,Thundersteel Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_ShortDesc,A one handed slashing blade imbued with Lightning & Withering
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_LongDesc,This barbarian's longsword is infused with the power to summon thunderstorms. Probably Dismounter. Commissioned by Wolfy.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_ThirdModifier,Lightning Infused
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492008_FourthModifier,Withering Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492009_Name,Green Seer's Battleaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492009_ShortDesc,A two-handed axe imbued with Healing Attacks & Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492009_LongDesc,"A hardened steel battle axe embossed with bronze and brass, it's heavy head allows for devastating strikes, furrows in the metal allow for a poison to be added which saps the life from the target with each hit. Commissioned by Ram."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492009_FirstModifier,Relic
