ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_Name,Inquisitor's Pairblades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_ShortDesc,"Dextrous matched blades, imbued with Brood Poison & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_LongDesc,Blades that are rumoured to have belonged the collection of a Dark Elf that she wore whilst carrying out her duties. Commission item.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_ThirdModifier,Healing Attacks (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492012_FourthModifier,Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492013_Name,Serpent's Fang Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492013_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Soulfire & Empowering Health"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492013_LongDesc,"These Curved blades forged for those who prove themselves worthy of the god set, Empower the users with the gods menace. Commissioned by Koriadris, Chosen of Set."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492013_FirstModifier,Relic
