ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492014_Name,(HA) (ToT Accessory) Zingarian Paladin Sheath
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492014_ShortDesc,Can be dyed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492014_LongDesc,"Commissioned by Zophar, Paladin of Mitra."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492014_FirstModifier,Epic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492015_ShortDesc,A two-handed katana imbued with Healing Attacks & Withering
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492015_LongDesc,"A Holy Blade of a Paladin of Mitra.  Made in Zingarian style, it is crafted for swift and accurate strikes in combination with footwork and mobility.  The blessings on the blade impart a holy strike to strip away the defenses of the wielder's opponents while simultaniously keeping the wiedler as safe from harm as possbile. Commissioned by Zophar, Paladin of Mitra."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492015_FirstModifier,Relic
