ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492015_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492016_Name,Flame of Defiance Shortspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492016_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Healing Attacks & Forgeflame
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492016_LongDesc,"Forged by master smiths in ages past, the weapon has never needed sharpening. Legends state that it only comes to the call of a warrior in a last stand situation, where desperation gives their voice the power to summon this blade to their side. Commissioned by Gideon."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492016_FirstModifier,Relic
