ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492016_FourthModifier,Forgeflame
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_Name,Shadow Queen Pairblades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_ShortDesc,"Dextrous matched blades, imbued with Lightning & Withering"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_LongDesc,"Nera was once an Elven Queen who wanted nothing more than to protect her people. She was a great warrior who didn't just fight she danced mixing magic and sword into a display of grace and deadly accuracy. She tried to gain power through a ritual. The ritual though was corrupted by evil and Nera fell into darkness. Losing her memories and who she once was. Her blades too changed, shrouded now in shadow magic the blades whisper of Nera's lost memories humming a tune of battle. ""Dance with me"" you might hear them say as you wield these swords once lost to time. Commission item."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_ThirdModifier,Lightning Infused
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492017_FourthModifier,Withering Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492018_Name,Arena Champion's Gladius
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492018_ShortDesc,A one handed blade imbued with Brood Poison & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492018_LongDesc,A well crafted and balanced blade that has seen much gladiatorial combat. The invigorating roar of the crowd is said to be heard with each strike landed. Tales have also been told of the blade sinking into the poisonous gland of a large serpent giving its strikes a rather nasty bite.  Commissioned by SkyTheGuy.
