ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492020_ShortDesc,"A small, fast one-handed blade imbued with Hellfire & Healing Finishers"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492020_LongDesc,"This knife, ripped from the very guts of the Soul Wastes, was forged with flame borne from one of the greater demon's bodies, before it had been passed around countless times, only ever held by the victor of the ones skilled enough to win the gladiatorial bouts. Now, however, it rests in the hands of a single woman, who above all odds; manages to fight even creatures double her size. Commissioned by .votary."
