ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492024_ShortDesc,A two-handed spear imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492024_LongDesc,"Often used by the likes of assassin's, this spear is balanced and light. Offering its wielder to use it mibly and deftly. It's said the design came to fame after an unnamed assassin chased their quarry with this custom made spear for over twenty miles, resulting in the victim to only, die tired. Commissioned by Nuclear Matter."
