ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492027_LongDesc,"The Iron Tyrant,  Vlad Von Cadwell: In shadows deep where thunder roars, There rose a king with iron's force. Vlad Von Cadwell, ruthless and true, With an iron blade that none could undo. The gods above in realms so high, Looked down on him with weary eye. Their thrones were built with stars and flame, But iron's wrath, it knew no name. With grip so cold and heart of steel, Vlad forged his path, his fate to seal. The blade of iron, sharp and bright, Gleamed in the heavens, striking night. Through clouds he soared with tyrants might, And gods quaked at his furious flight. Solonarium, the towering-sun, felt the blow, His light dimmed, a fading glow. The Twin Souls, god of morning and night, Tasted steel in the sacred land. The Beast King, lord of shifters and men, Sank beneath the waves, where darkness hides. Each god he found, each god he struck, Their powers bent to fate and luck. The blade of iron, merciless, pure, Pierced divine flesh with endless cure. From Isle of Storms  to White Thorns halls, The gods did fall with crashing calls. None could withstand the Iron King's rage, For he was the storm, the burning page. At last, he stood with gods all slain, A monarch born of death and pain. Vlad Von Cadwell, crowned in fire, A king whose wrath no god could mire. And so it’s told through ages wide, The day when gods and men did collide. Vlad’s iron blade, forever cursed, Left nothing but an empty universe. Commissioned by Benny."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492027_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492027_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492027_ThirdModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492027_FourthModifier,Golden Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492028_Name,Black Dragon Halberd
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492028_ShortDesc,A two-handed halberd imbued with Empowering Assault & Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492028_LongDesc,"An ancient Halberd bejewelled with masterful cut pieces of bronze and hardened steel ,a dragon design is featured upon it's blade. Weathering upon the blade shows many years of exposure to the elements, it was said to be part of a statue display in the hands of a ancient forgotten warrior warlord, now in the hands of someone who could make use of it. Commissioned by Ram."
