ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492029_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Withering & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492029_LongDesc,"A black bladed sword from the far east, rumoured to be crafted from the metal from a meteorite that it took a master smith many weeks of work to fully refine into a blade worthy of a warlords fireplace, but a sword of this quality deserves to be used. Commissioned by Ram."
