ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492030_LongDesc,"A high carbon steel weapon from the east, crafted from the broken haft of a full-sized Naginata, it's blade a dark and dangerous black with an edge that could cut through flesh, bone and armor alike with it's hefty head. Commissioned by Ram."
