ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492040_ShortDesc,Drag a weapon onto this to change the scaling to a standard Agility Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492040_LongDesc,"Item is removed when another item is dropped onto it. This item functions by changing the weapon's primary attribute scaling multiplier (which is usually Strength) to 10%, and the secondary scaling attribute multiplier (which is usually Agility) to 100%."
