ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492041_ShortDesc,Drag a weapon onto this to change the scaling to a standard Strength Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492041_LongDesc,"Item is removed when another item is dropped onto it. This item functions by changing the weapon's primary attribute scaling multiplier (which is usually Strength) to 100%, and the secondary scaling attribute multiplier (which is usually Agility) to 10%"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492041_FirstModifier,Consumable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492042_Name,(HA) Unrestricted Zero Weapon Scaling Modkit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492042_ShortDesc,Drag a weapon onto this to change the scaling to not grant any bonuses from attributes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492042_LongDesc,"Item is removed when another item is dropped onto it. This item functions by changing the weapon's primary attribute scaling multiplier (which is usually Strength) to 0%, and the secondary scaling attribute multiplier (which is usually Agility) to 0%."
