ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492044_Name,(HA) Testing Sword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492044_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword that boosts stamina, but drains the wielder's life"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492044_LongDesc,"A weapon whos legacy is written entirely in blood, so much so that it has permanently stained the blade. Pulled directly from a grave, weapons as old and as used as these often develop curses from the many deaths they're responsible for. Slowly deals damage to you while held, but also grants additional stamina."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492044_FirstModifier,Cursed Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492044_SecondModifier,Cripple
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492045_Name,Giantslayer's Ultra Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492045_ShortDesc,"A historic, oversized blade used once to bring down an empire"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492045_LongDesc,"A fabled blade, said to have been wielded by an awe-inspiring hero in the days of old. At the mercy of the giants, most of mankind faced the question of slavery or death. Forged in secrecy by highborn mages and lowborn smiths alike, it was used to deliver an answer their captors would not soon forget. If the legends are to be believed, the forgotten hero still lives; for death has not yet earned them."
