ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_Name,Divine Warmace
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_ShortDesc,"A holy implement, burdening foes with divine retribution"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_LongDesc,"Originally used in service of a great church after the death of their god, this mace was used to send a myriad of abominations and blasphemers back from whence they came. Holding it instills one with a great sense of purpose, as if they alone are the only one capable of saving this broken world. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_ThirdModifier,Guardstrike
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492066_FourthModifier,Bonesplitter
