ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492067_Name,Queenbreaker's Warspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492067_ShortDesc,"A beautiful pike, forged from the throne of a false queen"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492067_LongDesc,"When royalty forgets that it is the people they serve, not the other way around, they often find themselves torn down by those they had once sworn to protect. In a rebellion, the people did just that. Ransacking every inch of the castle and reclaiming all their taxed wealth, the people celebrated by tearing apart the grandiose seat of the former queen - followed not long after by doing the same to the queen herself."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492067_FirstModifier,Ascendant
