ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_ShortDesc,A massive two handed sword imbued with Healing Attacks & Soulfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_LongDesc,"A blade of midnight and storm, forged from the shattered essence of a dying realm. Its eerie glow pulses like a heartbeat, an unquenchable hunger for the souls of the fallen. Once wielded by Prince Riley Vespertine, its name lingers in whispers—a weapon of fate, ruin, and power beyond mortal grasp. Commission item."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492096_FifthModifier,Soulfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492097_Name,Frostfang Reaper Battleaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492097_ShortDesc,A two-handed axe imbued with Healing Attacks & Soulfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492097_LongDesc,"A legendary battleaxe once wielded by Ramu Ashura, its twin crescent blades forged from eternal ice that never melts. Adorned with intricate golden filigree and pulsing azure gemstones, it radiates an unyielding frost, freezing enemies with every strike. Said to channel the power of the heavens, only those deemed worthy can wield its immense power without succumbing to its chilling embrace. Commission item."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492097_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492097_SecondModifier,Weapon
