ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492102_ShortDesc,A small flintlock cartridge containing a solid steel bullet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492102_LongDesc,"In the far east, the booms of progress echoed out in the form of gunshots. The very first firearms had been made, and warfare would forever be changed."
