ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492107_Name,Executioner's Handaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492107_ShortDesc,"A wretched hatchet, disfigured and rotted by a terrible history"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492107_LongDesc,"A once holy artifact that had never seen combat, pilfered from a monestary by the Vilewolves. The beautiful weapon was said to have landed in the hands of a proud captain, who saw that the weapon served its violent purpose. The world suffered and rotted under the reign of the Vilewolves, and this weapon fared no better. Even now, remnants of their plague cling to its surface."
