ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_Name,Immortal Gladius
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_ShortDesc,"A one-handed spatha, blessed by merciless gods"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_LongDesc,"It is often said that the most successful gladiators are favored by the gods, and while often serving only to smother their learned talents, this weapon proves that not all is hearsay. This weapon was a divine gift, bestowed upon a renowned gladiator who amused both the crowds of men and gods with his prowess. Robert the Rebel's time has long since passed by, but this blade is no worse for wear than it was when it was forged in the heavens."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_SecondModifier,Weapon
