ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_FourthModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492121_FifthModifier,Invigorating Kills
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492122_Name,Champion's Shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492122_ShortDesc,"A powerful bulwark, wielded by a legendary gladiator"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492122_LongDesc,"One might take a glance at such metalwork and think it is suitable for no more than a wall decoration - and most would be correct. What use did the champion have of such a shield, when all his enemies were reduced to blood and dust?"
