ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_Name,King's Blade Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Brood Poison & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_LongDesc,A finely crafted longsword fit for a king. Commissioned by Wolfy.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_ThirdModifier,Brood Poison
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492130_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_Name,Fallen Valkyrie's Greathammer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_ShortDesc,A two-handed maul imbued with Healing Attacks & Lacerating Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_LongDesc,"A surprisingly light two handed hammer that seems to be made partially of enchanted ice. This weapon was left abandoned in the ruins of a nameless northen village for generations until it was recovered by one of its long since Exiled daughters. Much like her, it had been broken and abandoned until it was enchanted and given a second chance at life. It is rumored to serve House Arxan, a faint hum from the crystal at its base seems to indicate a longing to be returned home. To this end, the very weapon itself seems to rejuvenate the wielder in hopes of never being left on the field of battle again. Commissioned by OblivionCross."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_FourthModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492131_FifthModifier,Healing Attacks (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_Name,(HA) Arcane Forged Ultra Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_ShortDesc,A massive two handed sword imbued with Plagued Strikes & Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_LongDesc,This massive sword was forged with raw arcane energies and various magical stones. It simply does not just cut and slash. The unpredictability of the magical element can cause different wounds to apply. Commissioned by ChileProducts.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_FourthModifier,Plagued Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492132_FifthModifier,Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_Name,Dawn Justicar's Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Soulfire & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_LongDesc,"""In a world of shadow, I want to be the dawn that people look for on the horizon when the night is at its darkest."" Commissioned by ElftasticNicky."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_ThirdModifier,Soulfire
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492133_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_Name,Duskherald's Shortspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_ShortDesc,One-handed short spear imbued with Energizing Assault & Withering
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_LongDesc,"A short spear used by acolytes of the Duskherald, Khalis. Commissioned by Auzraiel / EspurrBuns."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_ThirdModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492134_FourthModifier,Withering Strikes (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492135_Name,Orc Smith's Greathammer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492135_ShortDesc,A two-handed maul imbued with Healing Attacks & Infernal Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492135_LongDesc,"A hammer crafted with far more skill and care than one might ordinarily find in the hands of an orc, but one crafted by an orc nonetheless. Despite its size and heft, this hammer is clearly more often used as a blacksmithing hammer, covered in soot, and blackened metal shavings. It is well-balanced, and when the light hits it, flame seems to flicker from within. Commissioned by Victorious."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492135_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492135_SecondModifier,Weapon
