ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492146_ShortDesc,A throwing weapon that seems to be able to be thrown repeatedly
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492146_LongDesc,"A wooden round shield with a steel rim, the grip is mounted in such a manner that the shield can be used for brawling or throwing. Commissioned by Ram."
