ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492148_ShortDesc,"A one-handed axe, imbued with Brood Poison & Fortifying Crits"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492148_LongDesc,"A simple weapon for a simple task, fashioned in the style of the northern tribes a simple slightly bowed wooden haft with steel bearded head, Used by reavers who stalk the shores in search of food, thralls and gold. Commissioned by Ram."
