ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492150_Name,xx_Orb_Radiant_Magelock_Bullet
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_Name,Vitae Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_ShortDesc,Daggers imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_LongDesc,The very name of the Daggers strikes fear into those who know what Vitae is. Many have faced those who wielded these very Daggers and none have lived to tell the tale. Commissioned by Manixx / Revan.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_ThirdModifier,Decaying Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492151_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_Name,Raven Wing Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_ShortDesc,Daggers imbued with Withering Strikes & Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_LongDesc,With the silence of a feather falling. These Daggers pose great threat to those injured by it. The rather distasteful toxins that coat the blade are rumored to have threatened the end of entire generations. Commissioned by Manixx / Revan.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_ThirdModifier,Energizing Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492152_FourthModifier,Withering Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_Name,Widow's Embrace Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_ShortDesc,Daggers imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Healing Attacks
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_LongDesc,The last memento of the Widow who sought to end any and all who were allied in the murder of her husband. The Daggers each hold a powerful paralytic and rejuvenating poison that was mixed into the very steel of the blades. Are you brave enough to wield these when knowing that death lurks behind every door? Commissioned by Revan.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_ThirdModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492153_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+1)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492154_Name,Hoarfrost Reaver's Pairblades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492154_ShortDesc,Dextrous blades held in each hand
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492154_LongDesc,"A pair of northern swords made in the Nordic style, hardened steel with carefully crafted leather wrapping the grip, used by reavers who stalk the shores in search of food, thralls and gold. Commissioned by Ram."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492154_FirstModifier,Epic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492154_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_Name,Chilling Battleaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_ShortDesc,A two-handed axe imbued with Healing Attacks & Plagued Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_LongDesc,"The battleaxe, encrusted with frost, bites deep, chilling the target to the bone.  Each strike eats at the targets life force, inflicting them with a plague unmatched. Commissioned by DayDreaming."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_ThirdModifier,Guardstrike
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492155_FifthModifier,Plagued Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492156_Name,(HA) Invisible Shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492156_ShortDesc,A shield
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492156_FirstModifier,Epic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_Name,Great General's Battleaxe
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_ShortDesc,"A two-handed splitter, once carried by the hero betrayed"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_LongDesc,"In a far-forgotten kingdom that chose to reward the greatest of its heroes with torture and execution, it should have come as little surprise when one chose not to give in so willingly to their punishment undeserved. As monumental a fall from grace as they come, the Fallen Hero tore the world he had once helped to save asunder, sparing none - for they had all stood by and watched as the knife was driven into his back, and they were no less deserving of his wrath than those that did this to him. Before he could bring about all things, the Great General, although just as wronged as the Fallen Hero, chose to stand against him. Putting an end to the threat and his closest friend, he secured the future of all livings things - but the battle left its mark on this world, just as it did the General's soul."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_ThirdModifier,Guardstrike
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_FourthModifier,Blade Phantom
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492157_FifthModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_Name,Evergrasp Throwing Shortspear
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_ShortDesc,"A two-handed javelin, slowly being consumed"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_LongDesc,"The never-ending void does not have an individual to represent it as its ruler; instead, it is governed by the concept that challenges all others: Chaos. It leaves its mark on everything it touches, and this spear is no exception. Long ago, it served the valiant purpose of fighting against abyssal nightmares, but now it remains as a warning. Chaos cannot be bested, and one distant day, it will consume everything."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_ThirdModifier,Throwing
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492158_FourthModifier,Chaotic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492159_Name,xx_Evergrasp_Shortspear_Projectile
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492160_Name,(HA) Essence of Chaos Modkit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492160_ShortDesc,Drag a weapon onto this to permanently change its properties
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492160_FirstModifier,Consumable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492161_Name,(HA) Unrestricted Balanced Weapon Scaling Modkit
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492161_ShortDesc,Drag a weapon onto this to change the scaling to favor both attributes evenly
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492161_LongDesc,"Item is removed when another item is dropped onto it. This item functions by changing the weapon's primary attribute scaling multiplier (which is usually Strength) to 55%, and the secondary scaling attribute multiplier (which is usually Agility) to 55%."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492161_FirstModifier,Consumable
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_Name,Blackheart Ultra Greatsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_ShortDesc,"A massive, cursed two handed sword imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_LongDesc,"While it is a reforged imitation of one of the Warmaker's weapons, there is still no escaping the cost of it's use. Commissioned by JackBright. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_SecondModifier,Cursed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_FourthModifier,Empowering Afflictions
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492162_FifthModifier,Decaying Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_Name,Itkus's Greathammer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_ShortDesc,A cursed two-handed maul imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Decaying Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_LongDesc,The forgemaster responsible for this abomination was sacrificed to his own creation by the monster that commissioned it. The spite from the blacksmith can be felt at all times while wielding it. Commissioned by JackBright.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_SecondModifier,Cursed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_FourthModifier,Empowering Afflictions
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492163_FifthModifier,Decaying Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_Name,Hanuman's Greathammer
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_ShortDesc,A two-handed maul imbued with Berserker's Empower & Slowness
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_LongDesc,"A Frost Giant boasted he could wield any weapon in Hanuman's arsenal with one hand, then he found this. Commissioned by JackBright."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_ThirdModifier,Shieldbreaker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_FourthModifier,Berserker's Empower
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492164_FifthModifier,Slowness
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492165_Name,(HA) Blooming & Withered Rose Pairblades
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492165_ShortDesc,"Dextrous matched blades, imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Empowering Assault"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492165_LongDesc,"A pair of blades thought lost to time, the very essence of the metal they're forged with breathes life and death. Those with an understanding of soul magic may feel a warmth of kindness as if a protective soul is embedded within the Blooming Rose, and a more cold, and foreboding dread, as if one may feel the sense of command and control emanating from within the Withered Rose. Two opposite, yet linked forces keep the two blades together, as if the souls of those who have long passed on from this world have blessed the pairblades. Commissioned by Alice."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492165_FirstModifier,Relic
