ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492167_ShortDesc,"A two-handed explosive axe that can be thrown, and charges when dealing damage"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492167_LongDesc,"A Heavy hammer made in the Nordic style, hardened steel with carefully crafted leather wrapping the grip, used by reavers strong enough to carry it with one hand who stalk the shores in search of food, thralls and gold. Commissioned by Ram."
