ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492183_ShortDesc,"Offhand blugeoning ward, shaped by the Weaver"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492183_LongDesc,"The Weaver, responsible for the threads of fate that guide mortal lives, charges her disciples with ensuring that destiny goes unchallenged. This shield is a weapon of one of those guardians, and carries with it her power."
