ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492184_ShortDesc,"A two-handed elegant point, forged in perfect balance"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492184_LongDesc,"A sword of duty and purpose, imbued with magics of light and dark. It is said that this weapon was forged by a group of people being hunted to the last man, with the intention of fighting back against those that would destroy their culture. They held a simple belief that guided them through the darkest of hours: When one falls, we continue. For those who come after."
