ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492202_Name,Explosive Satchel
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492202_ShortDesc,"A satchel of Dragonpowder, combined with a fuse"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492202_LongDesc,"Dragonpowder is renowned as one of the most dangerous and effective tools of destruction across the lands, and generations have spent both their time and lives to perfect it's usage. The brilliance of a damp, reinforced satchel to protect the powder from stray sparks and a long fuse that runs within has created what many might consider the pinnacle of contained destruction."
