ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492206_Name,Bloodthirsty Cutlass Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492206_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Healing Attacks"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492206_LongDesc,"A relic from a forgotten war, the Bloodthirsty Cutlass is a longsword stained crimson, its wickedly sharp edge constantly glinting as if freshly wet with a gruesome thirst. Legends whisper that the blade itself hungers for conflict, growing heavier and more potent with every drop of blood it sheds. Commissioned by DayDreaming."
