ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492232_ShortDesc,"Matching blades, imbued with otherworldly power"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492232_LongDesc,"A matching set of ornate swords forged to serve the unknowable, all-encompassing cosmic force joining all things just beyond our world. As with any weapon, it's true purpose is to kill. Regardless of the motive behind every taken life, the slain inevitably join  everything in Umbral, set to forever wander in search of their lost souls."
