ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492236_Name,Nightsky Landsknecht Striker
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492236_ShortDesc,"Offhand stunning weapon, infused with Cleansing & Frostburn"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492236_LongDesc,"A sleek Dagger befit for a mercenary; made from Nightsky - a mysterious material said to both protect against and hurt Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. Who or what used Nightsky to brandish such a weapon, is unknown. This weapon may have been forged by a young, yet skilled smith. Commissioned by Baldraz."
