ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492237_ShortDesc,A one handed blade imbued with Energizing Assault & Frostburn
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492237_LongDesc,"A slim blade, befit for a whimsical Wizard, made from Nightsky - said to both protect against and hurt Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. Who or what used this material is only known to a few. This weapon may have been forged by a young, yet skilled smith. Commissioned by Baldraz."
