ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492257_LongDesc,"There was once a Noble who thought himself better than everyone else, sometimes going as far as to bed the wives of his male servants and make sure they knew about it. One servant who was good with a Rapier pretended to show his blade off to the Noble, only for him to stab the noble through the head and only afterwards say the name of the Rapier, ""the pokerface."" Commissioned by Ame."
