ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_Name,Infernal Warspear of Chalchuamina
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_ShortDesc,A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Plagued Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_LongDesc,"A spear made from tradition, wielded to protect the forest and all beings living in harmony within. This spear was used by the ""Whisper of the Wind"" Chalchuamina. Its said the spear plagues those it strikes, and empowers its wielder against them. Commissioned by Sentique."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_ThirdModifier,Empowering Afflictions
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492271_FourthModifier,Plagued Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_Name,Infernal Warspear of Astrael
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_ShortDesc,A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Empowering Assault & Charged Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_LongDesc,"This warspear is said to have been wielded by starborn known as Astrael, who was known to fall from the heavens atop his foes. Commissioned by Sentique.s said to have been wielded by starborn known as Astrael, who was known to fall from the heavens atop his foes.Additional Info (optional): Commisioned by Sentique."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_ThirdModifier,Empowering Assault
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492272_FourthModifier,Charged Finishers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492273_Name,Drowned Promises Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492273_ShortDesc,Daggers imbued with Empowering Assault & Decaying Strikes
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492273_LongDesc,"Drawn in the lowest abyss beneath the Sea of Whispers, these daggers were forged where light dies and the castoff claw for survival. Their edge still bears grim ancestry, sharp with the memory of forgotten depths. No soul has ever given them up by choice; earned by strength and power. To wield them is to step into an ancient lineage of shadowed crowns and tide-marked doom, claimed by those left forgotten by the world around them. Their strikes hollow courage, their severing blows surge with stolen strength, and the sea itself seems to watch with a promise carved in fate. Commissioned by Abyss."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492273_FirstModifier,Relic
