ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_Name,Nightfarer's Helm
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_ShortDesc,"Sturdy covered armor, imbued with Onslaught"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_LongDesc,"A beautiful helm, given to the brother of two siblings as they sought to restore grace to an ever darkening world. Despite the profound dangers, knowing he stood side by side with his blood against this fate made everything simple. To him, no price was too great in order to keep his sister safe."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_SecondModifier,Medium Armor
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492280_ThirdModifier,Onslaught
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492281_Name,Nightfarer's Mask
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492281_ShortDesc,"An ornate metallic mask, imbued with Restage"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492281_LongDesc,"An ornate mask, given to the sister of two siblings charged with vanquishing a spreading darkness. While together made every effort to defeat the encroaching night, she quietly held the safety of her brother in an even higher regard; for what is a life without a reason to live it?"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492281_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492281_SecondModifier,Light Armor
