ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492285_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492285_FifthModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+4)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_Name,Blood Covenant Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_ShortDesc,"A wretched blade, with an appetite for blood"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_LongDesc,"They tell tales of a thief on the run, being chased for a murder she did not intend in his pursuit of her vanity. Trapped and cornered, she clasped her hands together, in prayer of any god who might answer - but it was a devil who appeared before her, all too eager to make the desperate woman's acquaintance. In her hour of need, the spawn of the hells produced a blade from its very own collection, and made a simple offer: ""Covetous thief, take my blade, and with it a fragment of my power. In exchange, everything it touches shall belong to me forevermore."" With the threat of justice closing in on her, the consequence of accepting the bargain was of little concern to her. On that fateful day, the streets ran red, and the devil hungers vanished - until the death of the thief, where she was condemned to join the lives she'd taken in eternal torment."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_ThirdModifier,Pain Attunement
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492286_FourthModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492287_Name,Dragonbane Halberd
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492287_ShortDesc,"An ornate polearm, once used in conquering the skies"
