ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492313_LongDesc,"""The Meistros were a roaming band of adventurers and mercenaries, that protected the weak and innocent alike. Over the years, their cause and their armor was lost to time. If a new wearer should ever don the new armor, may they be the bulwark against those who would do others harm."" Commissioned by Shaggymeister."
