ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492320_Name,Adriel's Demon Hunting Knife
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492320_ShortDesc,"A small, fast one-handed blade imbued with Energizing Assault & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492320_LongDesc,"""A Marine will often find a Tool he's made so fascinating and worth using to the point his very life force is poured into it, his very presence and mindset put within. This Knife was forged to Slay any any all beings that would seek harm to those The Marine swore to defend, and will always do as such. Embuing Boldness of Purpose, Shield of Faith, and Conviction Weaponized."" Commissioned by Vanguard."
