ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492323_ShortDesc,A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Energizing Assault & Slowness
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492323_LongDesc,"A long, blackened spear said to have been forged in the hush between heartbeats. It's blade is narrow and cruelly precise, etched with faint sigils that seem to swallow candlelight rather than reflect it. Commissioned by Nihil."
