ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492328_LongDesc,"In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations. Commissioned by Bengus."
