ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_Name,Muramasa Eastblade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_ShortDesc,"A two-handed katana, drenched in blood"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_LongDesc,"A family heirloom, passed through a powerline line of mercenaries. Despite the similar heritage, each descendant served many different masters, with many different ideals. This cursed edge claimed the lives of many an innocent, guilt-ridden, and those caught in between, coalescing into an amalgamation of gore and blood upon the blade. Centuries of use have turned a once fine edge into a jagged line fit only to rend flesh, and the souls claimed by the blade seem to plague your thoughts as you wield it. They all echo the same, terrible prophecy, its sanguine visions tormenting your mind: There will be bloodshed. There MUST be."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_FirstModifier,Ascendant
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_ThirdModifier,Bloodshed
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492363_FourthModifier,Lacerating Strikes (+4)
