ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_Name,Raven Talon Wildclaws
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_ShortDesc,"A set of claws, imbued with Healing Attacks & Lightning"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_LongDesc,These claw covers were inspired by the sharp talons of the corvids who made their home in the trees surrounding the home of the creators of these claws. The sharp hooks designed to inflict damage and pull in their victims. The blades themselves crackle with lightning. Commissioned by Sifenart.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_ThirdModifier,Rending Claw
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_FourthModifier,Healing Attacks (+2)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_FifthModifier,Lightning Charged
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492368_SixthModifier,Highmane's Arsenal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_Name,Ulfvar's Preybreaker Longsword
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_ShortDesc,"A one-handed sword, imbued with Healing Attacks & Decaying Strikes"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_LongDesc," A sword designed by the Master Hunter, Ulfvar Stormeye. His longsword is built for the hunt, favoring precise slashes that apply a creeping decay with each hit. This weakens and slows the target until it cannot run and hide any longer. In a skilled hunter's hands, it turns pursuit into control, making escape unlikely... and capture inevitable. The fur comes from a legendary beast Ulfvar killed during a defining hunt. Instead of wearing it, he bound it to the weapon that secured the kill. Along with some of his own fur from flesh he lost during fight. It’s a constant reminder that prey has the potential to become predator if you get careless... Commissioned by Captain Ordo."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_FirstModifier,Relic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_ThirdModifier,Healing Attacks (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492369_FourthModifier,Decaying Strikes (+3)
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_Name,Boreal Lance
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_ShortDesc,"A long, pole-like weapon with a sharpened end"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_LongDesc,Commission item.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_FirstModifier,Epic
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492370_ThirdModifier,Reach
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492371_Name,Permafrost Daggers
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492371_ShortDesc,Daggers imbued with Withering & Lightning
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTable.uexp,,HA_ItemTable_2492371_LongDesc,"A favored tool of both mages and assassins of the frozen north.  Said to have first been taken up in a desperate struggle for survival, the creation of these weapons has been refined over the ages; A vow of vengeance is sworn while the blades are carved from ice and bound with blood-tanned leather, ensuring that the blades will never melt nor chip until they strike down their intended target. Commissioned by Lunar Serpent."
