ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_Name,Thrashing Maul
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_ShortDesc,An ancient weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Before his coming they had filched steel weapons and armor from the Bossonians and Zingarans, or had hammered out their own crude arms from copper and bronze. Now a new world opened to them, and the clang of sledges re-echoed throughout the land.</> - The Hyborian Age

Mauls and warhammers are slow to swing and leave their user vulnerable to counterattack, but when they connect they are brutally effective. Armored foes are particularly vulnerable to these massive blunt weapons which break bones, shatter skulls and crush spines."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_FirstModifier,High Grade
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_SecondModifier,Weapon
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_ThirdModifier,Sunder
