ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_Name,Corrupting Brew
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_ShortDesc,A foreboding liquid of acrid yet sweet aroma
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_LongDesc,"<span style=""italic"">Even the arts you call sorcery are governed by cosmic laws.</> - The People of the Black Circle

Foul ingredients are brewed together to make this forbidden drink which corrupts body and soul. Sorcerers covet this libation, for they know that it nourishes a certain, long atrophied organ of the human soul, stimulating it to open like a nocturnal flower and become sensitive to the vibrations and blasphemies of the Outer Dark."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_FirstModifier,Drink
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_ThirdModifier,Corrupting
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,ItemTable_50561_Name,Throwing Axe of Nergal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,ItemTable_50561_ShortDesc,"A throwing-axe crafted of a dull, grey metal that radiates with intense coldness. "
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,ItemTable_50561_LongDesc,"This weapon traces its origins to a demon-haunted realm of shadow and ice ruled by Nergal, the Father of Bats. Artefacts from this terrible dimension are charged with Nergal's baleful hatred of all living things and radiate with supernatural coldness as a result. 

Held in the off hand, these axes can be used for hacking at enemy shields and, in an emergency, hurled at their faces."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,ItemTable_50561_FirstModifier,Throwing
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/HighmanesArsenal/HA_ItemTableOverwrites.uexp,,ItemTable_50561_SecondModifier,Returning
