ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/UI/BP_EAA_Fameshop_2.uexp,,6A24E48844151247AC6F05AAF1A4BCF0,"[You can scroll here]
Here you can enchant your EAA Accessories

They start with [I] means 1 and can go up to [X] means 10.

Keep in mind, on a fail, the whole item will be gone and cant be restored.

The Enchantment success rate are the following:

+1 -> +2 = 90%
+2 -> +3 = 80%
+3 -> +4 = 75%
+4 -> +5 = 70%
+5 -> +6 = 60%
+6 -> +7 = 50%
+7 -> +8 = 40%
+8 -> +9 = 30%
+9 -> +10= 20%

You need the Upgrade Material and
the Accessory
Then you can press the button.

A short delay will happen, its not worth
spamming the button.

You can get the Material and Accessories
from the Vendor.
All Accessories which are in your
Inventory will have a chance to get enchanted.

If you want to keep your Accs safe.
Store them or wear them.
"
