ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/UI/BP_EAA_Magic.uexp,,64F3376243ACED366C9848BE68338CF9,"All of my magic was affected by the engine update, and unfortunately none of the magic types are working anymore.
The issue isn’t the weapon type — it’s that all FX, particles, and animations
 are missing and no longer available in the devkit.

Because of this, I’ve decided to remove all magic content for now, as 
recreating 14 magic types, weapons, and combos from scratch 
would be a very large undertaking
I may revisit and rebuild the magic system in the future, but for now there are no concrete plans.

Sorry for the issues.
- Solvita"
