ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544336_LongDesc,This useful device presses and separates liquid from materials - such as oil from raw fish or seeds.
