ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544337_ShortDesc,"Faster, better, enhanced!"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544337_LongDesc,"With its circular action, this heavy, stone tool grinds greater masses of substances, more efficiently, than a simple mortar and pestle. It can be used to grind things like salt and spices down to useful granules and powders."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_Name,Enhanced Compost Heap
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_ShortDesc,"Faster, better, enhanced!"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_LongDesc,Ask not a man what goes into his compost heap. That is his business alone. It is what a man removes from his compost heap that matters.
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544339_Name,Enhanced Planter
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544339_ShortDesc,"Faster, better, enhanced!"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_Name,Enhanced Shellfish Trap
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_ShortDesc,"Faster, better, enhanced!"
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_LongDesc,"Much of humanity's earliest exercises in cunning and ingenuity came from staring at the water and devising an easier way to catch fish. Submersible cages made from wooden boards, and sometimes a mesh of metal, are employed in the pursuit of tasty shellfish."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544341_Name,Enhanced Cage of Pain
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544341_ShortDesc,Wheel of Pain without Slavemaster Slot
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_Name,Enhanced Preservation Box
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_ShortDesc,200 Slots
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_LongDesc,"Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay. This larger icebox holds more food and preserves it longer."
