ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_Name,[Trait Rune (Weapon)] Light Attack Damage
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_LongDesc,"Trait Runes are level based modifications. A Weapon, Armor and Tool can store up to 5 Levels - each trait rune increase the level by one. You cant remove the trait runes, once applied. After usage you see a notification which level your item have. Obviously, Armor Value on Weapons, Harvest Damage on Armor or Damage on Armor would make no sense."
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_FirstModifier,Enhanced Armory & Arsenal
ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_SecondModifier,Traitrune
