ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/Datatables/DT_EAA_Itemtable.uexp,,DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545248_LongDesc,"These swords have been perfectly balanced for the purpose of wielding both of them at the same time, sacrificing defense in favor of a flurry of blows being rained down on your opponent."
