ConanSandbox/Content/Mods/EnhancedArmoryAndArsenal/UI/BP_EAA_Class_Bandit.uexp,,9CEDA1384AE492C867582FB0A8D3A30E,"Class Artefacts



You can now purchase a Class Artefact.



Class Artefacts are equipped in the Artefact Slot within the EAA Inventory.



The artefact costs 300 EXP. Simply press ""Yes"" to purchase it.



- Available Artefacts

Blood Reaver – +3 Strength

Sand Jackal – +3 Agility

Beastbinder – +3 Authority

Golden-Tongue – +10% Movement Speed

Iron Warden – +200 Maximum Health



Important: You may equip only one Class Artefact at a time. There are no class restrictions, so you are free to choose whichever artefact best fits your playstyle."
